nt":"Considering Azul Sensatori for our hotel and they have a Karisma Always and Forever package that&#039;s free. Wondering what it all included and if it was lame. We will have about 20 people with us with some kids.","Attachments":[],"Id":1913213,"PostDate":1462062478,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Considering Azul Sensatori for our hotel and they have a Karisma Always and Forever package that's free. Wondering what it all included and if it was lame. We will have about 20 people with us with some kids.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweet.pea2018@mail.com","IpAddress":"65.30.181.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461609047,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sweetpea2018","Id":286809,"Name":"Sweetpea2018","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.248.183.177","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"332221b660423ea722572025d8eed56c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Is this in Jamaica?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913231,"PostDate":1462137549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Is this in Jamaica?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"06dixon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.248.183.177","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462125402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2017weddingguy","Id":286853,"Name":"2017weddingguy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.13.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d9395652f684c8c36b959bb9b81ca4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"2017weddingguy\"] There is both an Azul Sensatori in Jamaica and in Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913235,"PostDate":1462141702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286853\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286853-2017weddingguy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">2017weddingguy<\/span><\/a> There is both an Azul Sensatori in Jamaica and in Mexico.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.30.181.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5aab8aec9173edc1bebe655e58b6e10d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"2017weddingguy\" post=\"1913231\" timestamp=\"1462133949\"]\nIs this in Jamaica?[\/quote]\nYes there is one in Jamaica :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1913237,"PostDate":1462148886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>2017weddingguy, on 01 May 2016 - 09:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Is this in Jamaica?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYes there is one in Jamaica <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweet.pea2018@mail.com","IpAddress":"65.30.181.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461609047,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sweetpea2018","Id":286809,"Name":"Sweetpea2018","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.54.5.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0bcd1531e5bf401ec0d58df2e0dd417","RawContent":"Sweet pea - thanks for sharing. This is my top choice as well. Have you reached out to the hotel yet? If you have any wedding info please share.","Attachments":[],"Id":1913238,"PostDate":1462149132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sweet pea - thanks for sharing. This is my top choice as well. Have you reached out to the hotel yet? If you have any wedding info please share. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"06dixon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.248.183.177","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462125402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2017weddingguy","Id":286853,"Name":"2017weddingguy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Bride2Be2017, 08 June 2016 - 11:51 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1465429869,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bc580e7e11835f5405a9575e7eaefb1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi&amp;nbsp;Sweetpea2018 and 2017weddingguy,&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nI&#039;m currently researching venues in Jamaica and took an exploratory trip there last month. We didnt have Azul Sentatori on our final list but at the suggestion of a chef at our hotel in Runaway Bay, we made the trip. No appointment, no tour requested, no guarantee they would even let us past the gate. Thankfully, when we arrived we were able to get an abridged impromptu wedding site inspection tour. The immediate curb appeal of the hotel driving up to the gate, leaves much to be desired, but once we got into the front lobby, we were absolutely blown away!! We even got a glimpse of wedding that was being set up, and it looked really beautiful. The setting couldn&#039;t have been more serene. If you are planning on having 20+ guests I HIGHLY suggest you contact the wedding team. After a peek at the wedding we (me, my fiance and parents) were invited invited to the wedding department, where they showed us pictures of other weddings, let us look through books of sample menus, flower arrangements, entertainment, everything.\n\nWe toured the entire northern coast of Jamaica during our visit, none of the sunsets on the island can beat what we saw in Negril. The only drawback for me is that Negril is far away from some of some of Jamaica&#039;s biggest attractions that I want my family and friends to experience during their trip (Dunn&#039;s River, Bamboo Rafting, Bobsledding, Blue Hole). But I just may have to get over it. After all, Negril has the 7-mile beach! I&#039;m still torn as to which location to choose - Negril or Runaway Bay. I included a picture of the wedding set-up we saw. It was a sunset wedding and it had just rained. The picture doesn&#039;t really do it justice, because even as a passerby the wedding not only looked beautiful but FELT beautiful; and isn&#039;t that what you want on your wedding day? I hope you can see why I&#039;m so torn.&amp;nbsp;We are hoping to get married next summer. Need to decide soon - eek!\n\n\nBelow are some pics of our speedy but wonderful tour at Azul Sensatori in early May 2016.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/drive.google.com\/folderview?id=0BxyrmFa8BxWQSC1iMzZqYXZZNEE&amp;amp;usp=sharing&#039;&gt;Azul Sensatori Jamaica - May 2016 Site Inspection Tour&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914277,"PostDate":1465429610,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi\u00a0Sweetpea2018 and 2017weddingguy,\u00a0<br><br>\nI'm currently researching venues in Jamaica and took an exploratory trip there last month. We didnt have Azul Sentatori on our final list but at the suggestion of a chef at our hotel in Runaway Bay, we made the trip. No appointment, no tour requested, no guarantee they would even let us past the gate. Thankfully, when we arrived we were able to get an abridged impromptu wedding site inspection tour. The immediate curb appeal of the hotel driving up to the gate, leaves much to be desired, but once we got into the front lobby, we were absolutely blown away!! We even got a glimpse of wedding that was being set up, and it looked really beautiful. The setting couldn't have been more serene. If you are planning on having 20+ guests I HIGHLY suggest you contact the wedding team. After a peek at the wedding we (me, my fiance and parents) were invited invited to the wedding department, where they showed us pictures of other weddings, let us look through books of sample menus, flower arrangements, entertainment, everything.<br>\nWe toured the entire northern coast of Jamaica during our visit, none of the sunsets on the island can beat what we saw in Negril. The only drawback for me is that Negril is far away from some of some of Jamaica's biggest attractions that I want my family and friends to experience during their trip (Dunn's River, Bamboo Rafting, Bobsledding, Blue Hole). But I just may have to get over it. After all, Negril has the 7-mile beach! I'm still torn as to which location to choose - Negril or Runaway Bay. I included a picture of the wedding set-up we saw. It was a sunset wedding and it had just rained. The picture doesn't really do it justice, because even as a passerby the wedding not only looked beautiful but FELT beautiful; and isn't that what you want on your wedding day? I hope you can see why I'm so torn.\u00a0We are hoping to get married next summer. Need to decide soon - eek!<br><br>\nBelow are some pics of our speedy but wonderful tour at Azul Sensatori in early May 2016.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/drive.google.com\/folderview?id=0BxyrmFa8BxWQSC1iMzZqYXZZNEE&usp=sharing' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Sensatori Jamaica - May 2016 Site Inspection Tour<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theharriswedding2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465340853,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287094.jpg?_r=1465831329","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2Be2017","Id":287094,"Name":"Bride2Be2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.105.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bbd5756a598c4c22c91551c01d1ecf1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Bride2Be2017\"] We will be in Runaway bay next week photographing a wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay (staying at the Grand Bahia a couple of KM away). If you&#039;re interested we could share some photos from our experience there and hopefully that you will give you an idea (at least from a photographers perspective) as to what might work for you in Runaway Bay compared to Negril. &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914281,"PostDate":1465439717,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287094\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287094-bride2be2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2Be2017<\/span><\/a> We will be in Runaway bay next week photographing a wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay (staying at the Grand Bahia a couple of KM away). If you're interested we could share some photos from our experience there and hopefully that you will give you an idea (at least from a photographers perspective) as to what might work for you in Runaway Bay compared to Negril. <3<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464799539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.13.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52cc2a89eb35489ae2985b97e3d154ee","RawContent":"Interesting. I briefly talked to a travelling agent about Azul Sensatori in Negril and they said they primarily catered to the European market. Where are you located?\n\n\nSent from my SM-G928T using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1914282,"PostDate":1465440602,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Interesting. I briefly talked to a travelling agent about Azul Sensatori in Negril and they said they primarily catered to the European market. Where are you located?<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G928T using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sjlova86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"128.135.16.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464900399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287064.jpg?_r=1468714252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":198,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"sjlova86","Id":287064,"Name":"sjlova86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b17cfacdd48dc772beea4e47461c6f5","RawContent":"@[member=\"JasminMattPhoto\"] That would be GREAT! I would love to see some photos of your trip to Runaway Bay. Please do keep me posted when you get back! \n\nI really love the Runaway Bay area, I think it&#039;s the all around best location to stay on the island for a vacation. I&#039;m pretty decided that most of our guests will stay at Grand Bahia but I wasn&#039;t thrilled with their actual wedding locations - at least 3 weddings a day like clockwork. I loved my stay as a guest there but dont think the location would make me a happy bride. Now considering booking a villa for the wedding day and bus ppl there. Please let me know if you see any place interesting that I missed have missed if you explore! \n\n [quote name=\"JasminMattPhoto\" post=\"1914281\" timestamp=\"1465436117\"]\n@[member=\"Bride2Be2017\"] We will be in Runaway bay next week photographing a wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay (staying at the Grand Bahia a couple of KM away). If you&#039;re interested we could share some photos from our experience there and hopefully that you will give you an idea (at least from a photographers perspective) as to what might work for you in Runaway Bay compared to Negril. &amp;lt;3[\/quote]\n@[member=\"sjlova86\"]  I am based in NYC [quote name=\"sjlova86\" post=\"1914282\" timestamp=\"1465437002\"]\nInteresting. I briefly talked to a travelling agent about Azul Sensatori in Negril and they said they primarily catered to the European market. Where are you located?\n\nSent from my SM-G928T using Tapatalk[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1914289,"PostDate":1465491352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287055-jasminmattphoto\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JasminMattPhoto<\/span><\/a> That would be GREAT! I would love to see some photos of your trip to Runaway Bay. Please do keep me posted when you get back!\u00a0<br><br>\nI really love the Runaway Bay area, I think it's the all around best location to stay on the island for a vacation. I'm pretty decided that most of our guests will stay at Grand Bahia but I wasn't thrilled with their actual wedding locations - at least 3 weddings a day like clockwork. I loved my stay as a guest there but dont think the location would make me a happy bride. Now considering booking a villa for the wedding day and bus ppl there. Please let me know if you see any place interesting that I missed have missed if you explore!\u00a0<br><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JasminMattPhoto, on 09 June 2016 - 02:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287094\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287094-bride2be2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2Be2017<\/span><\/a> We will be in Runaway bay next week photographing a wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay (staying at the Grand Bahia a couple of KM away). If you're interested we could share some photos from our experience there and hopefully that you will give you an idea (at least from a photographers perspective) as to what might work for you in Runaway Bay compared to Negril. <3<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287064\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287064-sjlova86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sjlova86<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I am based in NYC\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>sjlova86, on 09 June 2016 - 02:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Interesting. I briefly talked to a travelling agent about Azul Sensatori in Negril and they said they primarily catered to the European market. Where are you located?<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G928T using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theharriswedding2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465340853,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287094.jpg?_r=1465831329","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2Be2017","Id":287094,"Name":"Bride2Be2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.237.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"809385448c8eb883fae9c420b8d1d3bd","RawContent":"Following because I LOVE Negril and want the sensatori location but I haven&#039;t found any reviews and all the packages I&#039;ve been looking at say that they don&#039;t apply to Jamaica. Help!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914323,"PostDate":1465680771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Following because I LOVE Negril and want the sensatori location but I haven't found any reviews and all the packages I've been looking at say that they don't apply to Jamaica. Help!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396405780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80067","Title":"Any Karisma Jamaica Brides?","LastPostDate":1467766852},"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
