039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt; Jade Thread&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt; is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);font-size:10pt;\"&gt;* edited to add attachment of NOW Jade Resort Pictures&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);font-size:10pt;\"&gt;** Please note, the information in this thread and on BDW has not been verified and is not guaranteed. &amp;nbsp;The resort may change their wedding packages, pricing, details, etc. at any time without giving notice. &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is just to be used as a guideline and not as a contract of what the resort or BDW guarantees.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt; &amp;nbsp;When you are ready to book and sign a contract with the resort, you will need to rely on the information they have given you.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595151,"PostDate":1331759358,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);font-size:10pt\">This is the new OFFICIAL NOW Jade wedding thread!<\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Here you will find the answer to almost all of your questions!\u00a0 If you don't see the answer, feel free to ask, but please look through the information first.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78683\/official-now-jade-wedding-thread#post_1744720' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color:#008080\">Post #2<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/sp