; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Chair bows $5 each, if you bring your own there is a $1 iron fee&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;White tiffany chairs $9&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Brown tiffany chairs $7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Fire dancers $1,000 a performance&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Excursion contact alex.orozco@yourcancundmc.com , her name is Alejandra&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Day Pass $55 per persona&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595159,"PostDate":1331759394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Details - <\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">if you uncover some other random expenses or options, please PM or email me!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The wedding canopy is 2 meters per side (approximately 6 ft x 6 ft)<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Walkway can be red or white to Pergola<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">3 foot long sparklers $5 per sparkler.\u00a0 Small metal ones $3\/6<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Projector for slideshow $300<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Welcome bag distribution $2-3 a bag<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">$40 for dress cleaning (after TTD session!)<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"