om\/image\/id\/762722\/width\/335\/height\/480\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Maya Floral&lt;\/strong&gt; - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #181818\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Centerpieces with local flowers start at $65.00 usd. The flowers we consider as local flowers because they are very easy to get in Mexico are: Roses, Alstroemerias, Snapdragon, Lisianthus, Asian Lilies, Mums, Gerbera daisy, Chrysantemun and some others. We do not have centerpieces (unless they are cocktail centerpieces) under this price, our average priced centerpieces are $75.00 \/ $80.00 usd, centerpieces that include fine flowers like Orchids, Tulips, etc, start at $85.00 usd&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595160,"PostDate":1331759397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong>FLOWERS<\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: blue\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"NOW Jade Your Moments Bouquet Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762676\/width\/600\/height\/506\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  sty