t-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">(998) 884 11 04, 887 17 00<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: blue\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bridesmaid Flowers.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762718\/width\/295\/height\/301\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Flowers Bridal Included v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762720\/width\/333\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Flowers Bridal Included.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762722\/width\/335\/height\/480\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <strong>Maya Floral<\/strong> - <a href='http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Centerpieces with local flowers start at $65.00 usd. The flowers we consider as local flowers because they are very easy to get in Mexico are: Roses, Alstroemerias, Snapdragon, Lisianthus, Asian Lilies, Mums, Gerbera daisy, Chrysantemun and some others. We do not have centerpieces (unless they are cocktail centerpieces) u