Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb224d56f17ac15535274d8b875f25cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great threat!! I haven&#039;t chosen the resort yet but its def one of my favorite. Looking at May 2013!!! Look forward to any other helpful information you can provide! Has any seen pictures of the reception on the beach?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596734,"PostDate":1332180048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great threat!! I haven't chosen the resort yet but its def one of my favorite. Looking at May 2013!!! Look forward to any other helpful information you can provide! Has any seen pictures of the reception on the beach?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lildior1113@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"199.107.16.121","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315927910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245272.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisdior","Id":245272,"Name":"chrisdior","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22ca15646ce1ec14950b3bf73593845a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thread*&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596735,"PostDate":1332180063,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thread*<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lildior1113@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"199.107.16.121","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315927910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245272.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisdior","Id":245272,"Name":"chrisdior","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e43cb7ad3b2faef3cd626cb9c8edcc7","RawContent":"I too was torn between Dreams Cancun and NOW Jade for this very reason! Jade just seemed more modern and new but I liked the location of Dreams Cancun, I believe it is right in the hotel zone &amp;amp; I LOVED the gazebo. I went back and forth for a while. If you know your group will be wanting to explore Cancun and it&#039;s nightlife, I think I would suggest Dreams Cancun. I ended up going with Now Jade b\/c most of my guest are only staying a short amount of time and most say the don&#039;t even want to leave the resort. I know this post was absolutely no help for you to make a decision but just thought I&#039;d share! LOL... Good Luck with which ever you chose. I don&#039;t think you can go wrong!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]EJay2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Thank you for the information,\n I am currently deciding between having my wedding at Now Jade and Dreams Cancun. I love the look of Now Jade, but love the location of Dreams Cancun( swimming with Dolphins!). Is transportation, i.e. taxi difficult to get to go into the nightlife area of Cancun. I heard Dreams Cancun was undergoing a renovation soon( this would be perfect), but I have not received a confirmation from the hotel. Any assistance provided is greatly appreciated.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1596908,"PostDate":1332234690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I too was torn between Dreams Cancun and NOW Jade for this very reason! Jade just seemed more modern and new but I liked the location of Dreams Cancun, I believe it is right in the hotel zone & I LOVED the gazebo. I went back and forth for a while. If you know your group will be wanting to explore Cancun and it's nightlife, I think I would suggest Dreams Cancun. I ended up going with Now Jade b\/c most of my guest are only staying a short amount of time and most say the don't even want to leave the resort. I know this post was absolutely no help for you to make a decision but just thought I'd share! LOL... Good Luck with which ever you chose. I don't think you can go wrong!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>EJay2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thank you for the information,<br \/> I am currently deciding between having my wedding at Now Jade and Dreams Cancun. I love the look of Now Jade, but love the location of Dreams Cancun( swimming with Dolphins!). Is transportation, i.e. taxi difficult to get to go into the nightlife area of Cancun. I heard Dreams Cancun was undergoing a renovation soon( this would be perfect), but I have not received a confirmation from the hotel. Any assistance provided is greatly appreciated.<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>62 guest booked, plus Bride and Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannon1@carolina.rr.com","IpAddress":"24.142.196.138","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1277912218,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229743.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shannonmarie","Id":229743,"Name":"shannonmarie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a0b088483b2a9ab5d0d58b9ce0fe950","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow, thanks for posting all this info - it will definitely come in handy as I try to finalize my resort choice!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596954,"PostDate":1332237735,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow, thanks for posting all this info - it will definitely come in handy as I try to finalize my resort choice!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pushkin22@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1328638715,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251124.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mlite83","Id":251124,"Name":"Mlite83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8c912d86f007073ac74dc6741ef357f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Has anyone had their reception (&amp;amp; possibly a DJ\/dance) on the beach???&amp;nbsp; That is our plan, but I would love to hear from someone else planning to do this or someone that has???&amp;nbsp; Also, I uncovered a new cost for this...recommended lighting package for $350+tax.&amp;nbsp; Just a heads up.&amp;nbsp; ;-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1599634,"PostDate":1332844455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Has anyone had their reception (& possibly a DJ\/dance) on the beach???\u00a0 That is our plan, but I would love to hear from someone else planning to do this or someone that has???\u00a0 Also, I uncovered a new cost for this...recommended lighting package for $350+tax.\u00a0 Just a heads up.\u00a0 ;-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"baileyandhilee@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331489091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252592.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"29Hmobile","Id":252592,"Name":"29Hmobile","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a27bd1af0b777e0501ef46b8c522bd1","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]29Hmobile[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Has anyone had their reception (&amp;amp; possibly a DJ\/dance) on the beach???  That is our plan, but I would love to hear from someone else planning to do this or someone that has???  Also, I uncovered a new cost for this...recommended lighting package for $350+tax.  Just a heads up.  ;-)[\/quote] \n \n \n I was looking to have the reception on the beach ( after the ceremony ) and Pilar told me they don&#039;t suggest it. Im not sure why am I have never been to the resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":1600204,"PostDate":1332933416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>29Hmobile<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Has anyone had their reception (& possibly a DJ\/dance) on the beach???\u00a0 That is our plan, but I would love to hear from someone else planning to do this or someone that has???\u00a0 Also, I uncovered a new cost for this...recommended lighting package for $350+tax.\u00a0 Just a heads up.\u00a0 ;-)<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> I was looking to have the reception on the beach ( after the ceremony ) and Pilar told me they don't suggest it. Im not sure why am I have never been to the resort.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lildior1113@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"199.107.16.121","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315927910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245272.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisdior","Id":245272,"Name":"chrisdior","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79374158b89845129cbef0b7a85b07de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Mostly due to the wind and the bugs&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1600321,"PostDate":1332944009,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Mostly due to the wind and the bugs<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Trisha~<\/p>\n<p>Destination Wedding Photographer & Travel Agent<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com\">www.faberphotography.com<\/a>\u00a0-\u00a0My latest destination wedding photos can be found\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/\">HERE<\/a><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Disney Specialist\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/\" title=\"\"><strong>Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\">\u00a0<br><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\">Looking for a travel agent that KNOWS DISNEY?<\/a><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">\u00a0 We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/\" title=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 | \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0| \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator |\u00a0<strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/\" title=\"\">Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/a>\u00a0|\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 | \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><br><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><\/span><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010\" title=\"\">Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178,34,34);\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com\" title=\"External link\">ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"trisha@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpg?_r=1452788764","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":296,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TATrisha","Id":207201,"Name":"TATrisha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d8ba693665dcbc0ba66a1b037a4e475","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Good to know.&amp;nbsp; She hasn&#039;t said anything to me about it yet, but hearing this, I&#039;ll ask.&amp;nbsp; THANK YOU for sharing!!!&amp;nbsp; :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1601350,"PostDate":1333127746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Good to know.\u00a0 She hasn't said anything to me about it yet, but hearing this, I'll ask.\u00a0 THANK YOU for sharing!!!\u00a0 :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"baileyandhilee@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331489091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252592.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"29Hmobile","Id":252592,"Name":"29Hmobile","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0c17b84dfc4e47f0bd76bd6de3b82b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the tips!!! We are planning a June\/July 2013 wedding at Jade- after becoming engaged there last year 10-10-11 :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602293,"PostDate":1333314733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the tips!!! We are planning a June\/July 2013 wedding at Jade- after becoming engaged there last year 10-10-11 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"landon.gwynn@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333313490,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253469.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":171,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LandonO","Id":253469,"Name":"LandonO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51214e7330562f00e4c9a07c2e5f135f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Just checking in to see how everyone is doing with the wedding planning with NOW Jade.&amp;nbsp; Yesterday we decided on this hotel.&amp;nbsp; Now we are working on how we should invite guests and what package to go with.&amp;nbsp; We first thought the Moments packet would be good as we wanted it simple, go with the buffet and maybe rent out a private room. No bridesmaids, etc....Than we thought they came all this way a dinner might be more appropriate.&amp;nbsp; Has anyone gone with just the eternity package and been happy with it??&amp;nbsp; We want to kind of keep the costs within reason and not spend much on extra such as a DJ, etc....or extra decorations.&amp;nbsp; Does anyone suggest things that are must haves and what we can talk to Pilar about maybe cutting back so we can have the wonderful dinner celebration.&amp;nbsp; We are having a reception at home, so again we wanted to keep it simple in a sense.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for any suggestions, so far everyone has been so helpful!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cortney&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602337,"PostDate":1333321676,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> Just checking in to see how everyone is doing with the wedding planning with NOW Jade.\u00a0 Yesterday we decided on this hotel.\u00a0 Now we are working on how we should invite guests and what package to go with.\u00a0 We first thought the Moments packet would be good as we wanted it simple, go with the buffet and maybe rent out a private room. No bridesmaids, etc....Than we thought they came all this way a dinner might be more appropriate.\u00a0 Has anyone gone with just the eternity package and been happy with it??\u00a0 We want to kind of keep the costs within reason and not spend much on extra such as a DJ, etc....or extra decorations.\u00a0 Does anyone suggest things that are must haves and what we can talk to Pilar about maybe cutting back so we can have the wonderful dinner celebration.\u00a0 We are having a reception at home, so again we wanted to keep it simple in a sense.\u00a0 Thanks for any suggestions, so far everyone has been so helpful!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cortney<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cschmitt17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331478389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252584.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cortneyadam","Id":252584,"Name":"cortneyadam","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5307,"TotalPages":531,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":5300},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
