> User gturano721 (287071)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db44dcd7066b47abd491fdc694f42809","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Side note we are having the wedding May 6, 2013!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602339,"PostDate":1333321741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Side note we are having the wedding May 6, 2013!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cschmitt17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331478389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252584.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cortneyadam","Id":252584,"Name":"cortneyadam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59e45a84952a61b47d99936c84e3ba6c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Cortney,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are going for the Eternity package next April.&amp;nbsp; For us, we wanted to include a sit down dinner at the very least -you are right, they are coming a long way to see you tie the knot, so I think it&#039;s nice to have a special\/private dinner :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So far this package is working well for us, includes a lot of the things we want (ie. hair, makeup, dinner, photos, etc).&amp;nbsp; I guess it depends on what you find most important though as to whether you get the best value out of it.&amp;nbsp; In the wedding guide, you can see the costs of not going with a package and just adding on things that you want.&amp;nbsp; It adds up pretty quickly but that approach might work for you too.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Jen&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602383,"PostDate":1333329696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Cortney,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are going for the Eternity package next April.\u00a0 For us, we wanted to include a sit down dinner at the very least -you are right, they are coming a long way to see you tie the knot, so I think it's nice to have a special\/private dinner <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> So far this package is working well for us, includes a lot of the things we want (ie. hair, makeup, dinner, photos, etc).\u00a0 I guess it depends on what you find most important though as to whether you get the best value out of it.\u00a0 In the wedding guide, you can see the costs of not going with a package and just adding on things that you want.\u00a0 It adds up pretty quickly but that approach might work for you too.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Jen<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen.duggan@ubc.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323990030,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248684.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jend","Id":248684,"Name":"jend","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cee2c59120e47c35297244ce3bd94ce4","RawContent":"Hi Cortneyadam, \n \n \n We were in the same boat as you. Started out with the Your Moments Package. We are only having about 18 guests and wanted to keep things small and intimate.  We decided to do the ceremony, then a 3 hour cocktail reception (with hors d&#039;ouvres and using our ipod for music) and then a reservation in one of the restaurants for dinner.  This seemed a more relaxed way to go with a smaller group rather than the normal dinner reception with DJ, etc.  We still have that plan but upgraded to the Eternity package.  It ended up saving us a little money and we got a few extras like a couples massage and bridal hair\/makeup.  I would price out all your options.  We upgraded to the Eternity package about a month ago...so you can always upgrade at a later date.  Happy planning!!!! \n \n Kerri \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]cortneyadam[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Everyone, \n Just checking in to see how everyone is doing with the wedding planning with NOW Jade.  Yesterday we decided on this hotel.  Now we are working on how we should invite guests and what package to go with.  We first thought the Moments packet would be good as we wanted it simple, go with the buffet and maybe rent out a private room. No bridesmaids, etc....Than we thought they came all this way a dinner might be more appropriate.  Has anyone gone with just the eternity package and been happy with it??  We want to kind of keep the costs within reason and not spend much on extra such as a DJ, etc....or extra decorations.  Does anyone suggest things that are must haves and what we can talk to Pilar about maybe cutting back so we can have the wonderful dinner celebration.  We are having a reception at home, so again we wanted to keep it simple in a sense.  Thanks for any suggestions, so far everyone has been so helpful!!! \n \n Cortney[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1602664,"PostDate":1333379679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hi Cortneyadam,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We were in the same boat as you.\u00a0Started out with the Your Moments Package. We are only having about 18 guests and wanted to keep things small and intimate.\u00a0 We decided to do the ceremony, then a 3 hour cocktail reception (with hors d'ouvres and using our ipod for music) and then a reservation in one of the restaurants for dinner.\u00a0 This seemed a more relaxed way to go with a smaller group rather than the normal dinner reception with DJ, etc.\u00a0 We still have that plan but upgraded to the Eternity package.\u00a0 It ended up saving us a little money and we got a few extras like a couples massage and bridal hair\/makeup.\u00a0 I would price out all your options.\u00a0 We upgraded to the Eternity package about a month ago...so you can always upgrade at a later date.\u00a0 Happy planning!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kerri<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>cortneyadam<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> Just checking in to see how everyone is doing with the wedding planning with NOW Jade.\u00a0 Yesterday we decided on this hotel.\u00a0 Now we are working on how we should invite guests and what package to go with.\u00a0 We first thought the Moments packet would be good as we wanted it simple, go with the buffet and maybe rent out a private room. No bridesmaids, etc....Than we thought they came all this way a dinner might be more appropriate.\u00a0 Has anyone gone with just the eternity package and been happy with it??\u00a0 We want to kind of keep the costs within reason and not spend much on extra such as a DJ, etc....or extra decorations.\u00a0 Does anyone suggest things that are must haves and what we can talk to Pilar about maybe cutting back so we can have the wonderful dinner celebration.\u00a0 We are having a reception at home, so again we wanted to keep it simple in a sense.\u00a0 Thanks for any suggestions, so far everyone has been so helpful!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cortney<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerri.cornell@bankofamerica.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309881115,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241983.jpg?_r=1411575568","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":191,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KerriCornell","Id":241983,"Name":"KerriCornell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90ebd3a728f75b0c3a39cfc9df834c0e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;My Fi and I selected the Eternity package for our +\/- 25 guests and we think this will be perfect for us.&amp;nbsp; We&amp;nbsp;didn&#039;t see any benefit (for us personally)&amp;nbsp;in the higher level package. &amp;nbsp;We will be adding a bit of decor, but this will all be furnished by us and I have spoken to Pialr and the set-up fees will be minimal.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;cortneyadam&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Side note we are having the wedding May 6, 2013!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602690,"PostDate":1333381696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">My Fi and I selected the Eternity package for our +\/- 25 guests and we think this will be perfect for us.\u00a0 We\u00a0didn't see any benefit (for us personally)\u00a0in the higher level package. \u00a0We will be adding a bit of decor, but this will all be furnished by us and I have spoken to Pialr and the set-up fees will be minimal.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>cortneyadam<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Side note we are having the wedding May 6, 2013!!<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326159751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a01c5e40775e657f2e921dc8da464770","RawContent":"Wanted to add that I am happy to see another May 2103 Now Jade Bride... Congrats!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]cortneyadam[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Side note we are having the wedding May 6, 2013!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1602691,"PostDate":1333381796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Wanted to add that I am happy to see another May 2103 Now Jade Bride... Congrats!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>cortneyadam<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Side note we are having the wedding May 6, 2013!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326159751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a30b17d5d8190b7dcfc0d40b87e8ed0","RawContent":"Just wondering if you have a quote from Pilar on how much the set-up fee is for items\/decor you bring from home?  Some resorts charge like crazy for this. I am hoping that is not the case with Now Jade!  Thanks!\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ChocoTaco7568[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=2][color=black][font=arial]My Fi and I selected the Eternity package for our +\/- 25 guests and we think this will be perfect for us.  We didn&#039;t see any benefit (for us personally) in the higher level package.  We will be adding a bit of decor, but this will all be furnished by us and I have spoken to Pialr and the set-up fees will be minimal.[\/font][\/color][\/size] \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1602724,"PostDate":1333385617,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just wondering if you have a quote from Pilar on how much the set-up fee is for items\/decor you bring from home?\u00a0 Some resorts charge like crazy for this. I am hoping that is not the case with Now Jade!\u00a0 Thanks!<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ChocoTaco7568<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">My Fi and I selected the Eternity package for our +\/- 25 guests and we think this will be perfect for us.\u00a0 We\u00a0didn't see any benefit (for us personally)\u00a0in the higher level package. \u00a0We will be adding a bit of decor, but this will all be furnished by us and I have spoken to Pialr and the set-up fees will be minimal.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pushkin22@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1328638715,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251124.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mlite83","Id":251124,"Name":"Mlite83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfce062da17e41b8ae51d9825908bfaa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; cortneyadam - I am doing the divine package and only have about 17 people coming to the wedding. I do worry that it might be weird having a regular dinner reception with a small amount of people but I think for us it will be worth it and makes sense. Plus I have been able to switch things out that I don&#039;t need or want and add things in at no extra cost. We are also having a reception back home (at my parents request!) I have about 6 weeks left so I will give a review and let you know if I should have gone with a different package! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602725,"PostDate":1333385750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> cortneyadam - I am doing the divine package and only have about 17 people coming to the wedding. I do worry that it might be weird having a regular dinner reception with a small amount of people but I think for us it will be worth it and makes sense. Plus I have been able to switch things out that I don't need or want and add things in at no extra cost. We are also having a reception back home (at my parents request!) I have about 6 weeks left so I will give a review and let you know if I should have gone with a different package! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katemiller21@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.51.81.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311844891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242886.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kitkat863","Id":242886,"Name":"kitkat863","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f2a580b778f4fc406578d790291a44e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Mlite,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am only being charged $65 USD which includes ironing and tying my satin chair sashes for the ceremony and reception ($1\/sash), and hanging my paper lanterns ($40 USD) for 30-40 lanterns.&amp;nbsp; When I sent my inquiry for these items I also asked for the set-up fee for ceremony decor (fans,&amp;nbsp;programs, sand ceremony),&amp;nbsp;my specific reception&amp;nbsp;table set-up&amp;nbsp;(cylinder glass floating candle centerpieces, votive candles, maracas, table runners) and a few receptions items (framed signage, guestbook and pens).&amp;nbsp; Per her email, this will all be set-up complimentary.&amp;nbsp; I have a few additional items that I have yet to mention. But I wouldn&#039;t be surprised if she adds a fee for these, since it will become more labor intensive. Either way, as long as my set-up fees stay under $100, I&#039;ll be happy. With all my DIY projects and scoping out best deals, I&#039;m saving a lot more money than if i were to get these items direct from the resort or another vendor.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Mlite83&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Just wondering if you have a quote from Pilar on how much the set-up fee is for items\/decor you bring from home?&amp;nbsp; Some resorts charge like crazy for this. I am hoping that is not the case with Now Jade!&amp;nbsp; Thanks!\n \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602739,"PostDate":1333387744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Mlite,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am only being charged $65 USD which includes ironing and tying my satin chair sashes for the ceremony and reception ($1\/sash), and hanging my paper lanterns ($40 USD) for 30-40 lanterns.\u00a0 When I sent my inquiry for these items I also asked for the set-up fee for ceremony decor (fans,\u00a0programs, sand ceremony),\u00a0my specific reception\u00a0table set-up\u00a0(cylinder glass floating candle centerpieces, votive candles, maracas, table runners) and a few receptions items (framed signage, guestbook and pens).\u00a0 Per her email, this will all be set-up complimentary.\u00a0 I have a few additional items that I have yet to mention. But I wouldn't be surprised if she adds a fee for these, since it will become more labor intensive. Either way, as long as my set-up fees stay under $100, I'll be happy. With all my DIY projects and scoping out best deals, I'm saving a lot more money than if i were to get these items direct from the resort or another vendor.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>Mlite83<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Just wondering if you have a quote from Pilar on how much the set-up fee is for items\/decor you bring from home?\u00a0 Some resorts charge like crazy for this. I am hoping that is not the case with Now Jade!\u00a0 Thanks!<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326159751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"706b38e4849a14e0a9d8a098774d314a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; wow sounds like the jade is very flexible and easy to work with.. that&#039;s definitely a plus! I&#039;m sooo confused i don&#039;t know which resort to pick &lt;span alt=\":-\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1333409052212_166\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602780,"PostDate":1333394813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> wow sounds like the jade is very flexible and easy to work with.. that's definitely a plus! I'm sooo confused i don't know which resort to pick <span alt=\":-\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1333409052212_166\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lildior1113@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"199.107.16.121","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315927910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245272.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisdior","Id":245272,"Name":"chrisdior","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4321a5cdfe58b911aa68db120399fe6","RawContent":"Keep in mind that I will only have +\/- 25 guests.  Since prices for setting-up bride\/groom furnished items isn&#039;t published anywhere, I could see some variation from one bridal couple to another.  For instance if your total guest count is 100 people, I can see them charging for special ceremony or reception table set-up.  All you can do is ask. \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]chrisdior[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n wow sounds like the jade is very flexible and easy to work with.. that&#039;s definitely a plus! I&#039;m sooo confused i don&#039;t know which resort to pick [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1602800,"PostDate":1333399129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Keep in mind that I will only have +\/- 25 guests.\u00a0 Since prices for setting-up bride\/groom furnished items isn't published anywhere, I could see some variation from one bridal\u00a0couple to another.\u00a0 For instance if your total guest count is 100 people, I can see them charging for special ceremony or\u00a0reception table set-up.\u00a0 All you can do is ask.\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>chrisdior<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> wow sounds like the jade is very flexible and easy to work with.. that's definitely a plus! I'm sooo confused i don't know which resort to pick <span alt=\":-\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1333409052212_166\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326159751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5307,"TotalPages":531,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":5300},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
