{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33d1da08a227d719e8432b8038df9ac2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Maybe all of us that are down there at the same time can get a bonus group discount!?&amp;nbsp; Are you thinking about purchasing the beverages from the resort...or going to a market to stock up??&amp;nbsp; I am still leaning towards the idea of just putting larger cups in the OOT bags and if we are only renting the gazebo for 2 hours...one or two trips to the bar can&#039;t be THAT bad??!!!&amp;nbsp; Or can it???&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Does anyone know if there are &amp;quot;clubs&amp;quot; or entertainment venues on the resort grounds?&amp;nbsp; It might be kinda fun for those in our parties that like to party longer to head to one of those after the gazebo ordeal?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1237594,"PostDate":1280506816,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Maybe all of us that are down there at the same time can get a bonus group discount!?\u00a0 Are you thinking about purchasing the beverages from the resort...or going to a market to stock up??\u00a0 I am still leaning towards the idea of just putting larger cups in the OOT bags and if we are only renting the gazebo for 2 hours...one or two trips to the bar can't be THAT bad??!!!\u00a0 Or can it???\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Does anyone know if there are \"clubs\" or entertainment venues on the resort grounds?\u00a0 It might be kinda fun for those in our parties that like to party longer to head to one of those after the gazebo ordeal?!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a49853b7db5f655d9052702329b29d1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;I heard from other brides that there is a beach party on Tuesday nights which is a lot of fun, so we&#039;re just going to party there after the wedding.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not going to have enuogh people to justify renting out a place, and buying booze and&amp;nbsp; everything, so we&#039;ll party with everyone else and then I get congratulationg from everyone I walk by and I&#039;m not going to lie, I&#039;m looking forward to everyone seeing me in my dress, even if its strangers!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; There is also a club too, I haven&#039;t heard anything about it but it will be your wedding so I&#039;m pretty sure no matter what you will be having a good time!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Question for you guys, we&#039;re getting married at 2, do you know what time they have the supper afterwards?&amp;nbsp; Will it be at 6, or do they ahve it set up based on the other weddings\/&amp;nbsp; Any ideas on this?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1237663,"PostDate":1280509445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0I heard from other brides that there is a beach party on Tuesday nights which is a lot of fun, so we're just going to party there after the wedding.\u00a0 I'm not going to have enuogh people to justify renting out a place, and buying booze and\u00a0 everything, so we'll party with everyone else and then I get congratulationg from everyone I walk by and I'm not going to lie, I'm looking forward to everyone seeing me in my dress, even if its strangers!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> There is also a club too, I haven't heard anything about it but it will be your wedding so I'm pretty sure no matter what you will be having a good time!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Question for you guys, we're getting married at 2, do you know what time they have the supper afterwards?\u00a0 Will it be at 6, or do they ahve it set up based on the other weddings\/\u00a0 Any ideas on this?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8041a8f8d08a31422ea5c3a230a7ebff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think if your only having the semi private dinner and not renting out the whole restarurant you have to wait until the a la carte regularly opens...which is probably around 6ish I&#039;d say.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; and thanks for the info about the beach party...im also getting married on a tuesday so this is good info to know and possibly save some $$&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1238115,"PostDate":1280526060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think if your only having the semi private dinner and not renting out the whole restarurant you have to wait until the a la carte regularly opens...which is probably around 6ish I'd say.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> and thanks for the info about the beach party...im also getting married on a tuesday so this is good info to know and possibly save some $$<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;46;23\/st\/20110111\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/16e1\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...16e1\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sara.willy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1259221185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223542.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soontobemrsdow","Id":223542,"Name":"soontobemrsdow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a34d52c0dcf9958b794c79edbebbb7ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hmm I will definitely have to find out more info about bringing our own booze.&amp;nbsp; That would be way cheaper!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Beverly told me that dinner is at 6:30 and I asked if we could do it earlier and she never really answered me so I&#039;m not totally sure about that.&amp;nbsp; She made it sound like its 6:30, no earlier...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1238191,"PostDate":1280529043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hmm I will definitely have to find out more info about bringing our own booze.\u00a0 That would be way cheaper!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Beverly told me that dinner is at 6:30 and I asked if we could do it earlier and she never really answered me so I'm not totally sure about that.\u00a0 She made it sound like its 6:30, no earlier...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1254c71a49bcdd637d2f86f870523a2e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; after months of indecisiveness me and my fiancee (well...more like just me) finally decided on GBP and had our wedding date booked for next June!! so excited!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bear with me if i start asking tons of questions! you guys are fantastic!!!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1240724,"PostDate":1280790149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> after months of indecisiveness me and my fiancee (well...more like just me) finally decided on GBP and had our wedding date booked for next June!! so excited!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> bear with me if i start asking tons of questions! you guys are fantastic!!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"emikurukuru@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1271051185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227247.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"emi","Id":227247,"Name":"emi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab6a754a907a47dd47358e16da3c9e8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies! I&#039;m a Negril bride, but I might just be jumping ship for GBP. I have a quick question for you! Did you all work with a travel agent or go directly through Gran Bahia Principe? Do guests have to pay for their trip in full in order to book or do they accept a deposit?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1240771,"PostDate":1280794031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies! I'm a Negril bride, but I might just be jumping ship for GBP. I have a quick question for you! Did you all work with a travel agent or go directly through Gran Bahia Principe? Do guests have to pay for their trip in full in order to book or do they accept a deposit?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yaba.blay@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1269684239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226829.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"selassie11","Id":226829,"Name":"selassie11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c40cbdf7e64cc03e2822d46630aa21a","RawContent":"From what I&#039;ve been reading on here it seems like us Canadian brides go with the all inclusive package - flight and hotel and it seems that in the U.S people tend to book them separately (im not sure why this is, our TA never offered to book flights and hotel seperately so we just went with the package). For us, guests have to put down an initial deposit of $200 and then they can pay any amount, any time but the trip most be paid in full 30 days before we leave. \n \n Good luck planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1240877,"PostDate":1280800050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                From what I've been reading on here it seems like us Canadian brides go with the all inclusive package - flight and hotel and it seems that in the U.S people tend to book them separately (im not sure why this is, our TA never offered to book flights and hotel seperately so we just went with the package). For us, guests have to put down an initial deposit of $200 and then they can pay any amount, any time but the trip most be paid in full 30 days before we leave. <br> <br> Good luck planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd31dbbcdde7ef56032ebc7df6f91c0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I was also told dinner at 6:30 and our wedding is at 1pm, so I&#039;m guessing everyones dinner is then....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My FI and I are just going to buy a couple bottles and mix. We also only have the gazebo for 2hrs., and figured that we could have some there for the beginning, and then let people go for the walk! Hopefully they&#039;ll come back! After 1030 we just plan on making our way to the disco to keep the celebration going!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We used a TA to book everything all inclusive. The only time I was given separate flight\/accommodation pricing was when I was looking into pricing for people who only want to come for 3 nights.....All my guest had to give a $200 deposit and the remainder was due 2months before we leave....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1240966,"PostDate":1280804801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I was also told dinner at 6:30 and our wedding is at 1pm, so I'm guessing everyones dinner is then....<\/p> <p> My FI and I are just going to buy a couple bottles and mix. We also only have the gazebo for 2hrs., and figured that we could have some there for the beginning, and then let people go for the walk! Hopefully they'll come back! After 1030 we just plan on making our way to the disco to keep the celebration going!\u00a0<\/p> <p> We used a TA to book everything all inclusive. The only time I was given separate flight\/accommodation pricing was when I was looking into pricing for people who only want to come for 3 nights.....All my guest had to give a $200 deposit and the remainder was due 2months before we leave....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec0e64bd7e185a34fc185a9fa491f9c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks ladies!! I&#039;m hoping everything works out...then I&#039;ll be a GBP bride too!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1241059,"PostDate":1280808835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks ladies!! I'm hoping everything works out...then I'll be a GBP bride too!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yaba.blay@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1269684239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226829.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"selassie11","Id":226829,"Name":"selassie11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6bc1f1c825e6ed51a2d166d71aaa37a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We booked through a Travel Agent and she hooked us up with FunJet vacations and we are doing the all-inclusive option too...she also got us an additional wedding discount that is per reservation and starts at atleast $50...so that was nice.&amp;nbsp; She gave us flyers to send out with our invites and said that people could book everything as a package through her or they could find their own flights and just book the accommodations through her if they wanted to or whatever...as long as the reservation&amp;nbsp;amount that was booked through her was&amp;nbsp;at least $1000, they would get at least&amp;nbsp;$50 off!&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t complain about that!&amp;nbsp; But&amp;nbsp;our guests&amp;nbsp;do have options of going either way...all-inclusive or not...to me it is much&amp;nbsp;more simplified to go the all-inclusive route...especially with the price being right.&amp;nbsp; She quoted us $470 for airfare and $778&amp;nbsp;per person for&amp;nbsp;7 nights...loving the prices!!!&amp;nbsp; Our guests have to pay the airfare portion and $200 of the accommodation costs upfront...the remainder is due at the end of March...(we are getting married in May)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; As&amp;nbsp;far as the booze option goes,&amp;nbsp;I think we are just going to get large, personalized&amp;nbsp;beverage cups to put in the OOT&amp;nbsp;bags and being that&amp;nbsp;the gazebo part is only 2 hours...hopefully that will only equal 1 or&amp;nbsp;2 trips to the bar!?&amp;nbsp; Haven&#039;t totally decided on that&amp;nbsp;one yet...just seems like a hassel because we also have&amp;nbsp;people who don&#039;t drink, so we wouldn&#039;t want to be unfair to them...so that would mean purchasing soda too!?  &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"53\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile105.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"56\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1241499,"PostDate":1280853067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We booked through a Travel Agent and she hooked us up with FunJet vacations and we are doing the all-inclusive option too...she also got us an additional wedding discount that is per reservation and starts at atleast $50...so that was nice.\u00a0 She gave us flyers to send out with our invites and said that people could book everything as a package through her or they could find their own flights and just book the accommodations through her if they wanted to or whatever...as long as the reservation\u00a0amount that was booked through her was\u00a0at least $1000, they would get at least\u00a0$50 off!\u00a0 I can't complain about that!\u00a0 But\u00a0our guests\u00a0do have options of going either way...all-inclusive or not...to me it is much\u00a0more simplified to go the all-inclusive route...especially with the price being right.\u00a0 She quoted us $470 for airfare and $778\u00a0per person for\u00a07 nights...loving the prices!!!\u00a0 Our guests have to pay the airfare portion and $200 of the accommodation costs upfront...the remainder is due at the end of March...(we are getting married in May)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As\u00a0far as the booze option goes,\u00a0I think we are just going to get large, personalized\u00a0beverage cups to put in the OOT\u00a0bags and being that\u00a0the gazebo part is only 2 hours...hopefully that will only equal 1 or\u00a02 trips to the bar!?\u00a0 Haven't totally decided on that\u00a0one yet...just seems like a hassel because we also have\u00a0people who don't drink, so we wouldn't want to be unfair to them...so that would mean purchasing soda too!?\u00a0\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"53\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile105.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"56\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":200,"NextPage":210,"PreviousPage":190,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
