> User bellabride2018 (287346)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b60e923de4d6cbbacb597ac1592e211c","RawContent":"From the photos I really like the location of the Italian restaurant too! That&#039;s where we are probably having our reception dinner. Missy are you guys paying the extra $2500 for the private reception room?","Attachments":[],"Id":1247884,"PostDate":1281393700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                From the photos I really like the location of the Italian restaurant too! That's where we are probably having our reception dinner. Missy are you guys paying the extra $2500 for the private reception room?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8eb023c737dcbb0254842cab0b9e09d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Missy, I was quoted $500 for the DJ and Beverly told me to bring my own CDs as well!&amp;nbsp; Like you said, what is the point of paying all that money when all he had to do is press a button?!?!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; As far as the restaurant.... I&#039;m still not sure if I&#039;m going to pay the $2500 to have it private.&amp;nbsp; What did Beverly tell you about the food options?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m sooooo confused!&amp;nbsp; If I&#039;m correct, if it&#039;s semi-private, the food is no charge, but if you pay the $2500 to have it private, you have to pay for your food.&amp;nbsp; Does this make sense??&amp;nbsp; What has Beverly told you guys?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1248057,"PostDate":1281406895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Missy, I was quoted $500 for the DJ and Beverly told me to bring my own CDs as well!\u00a0 Like you said, what is the point of paying all that money when all he had to do is press a button?!?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As far as the restaurant.... I'm still not sure if I'm going to pay the $2500 to have it private.\u00a0 What did Beverly tell you about the food options?\u00a0 I'm sooooo confused!\u00a0 If I'm correct, if it's semi-private, the food is no charge, but if you pay the $2500 to have it private, you have to pay for your food.\u00a0 Does this make sense??\u00a0 What has Beverly told you guys?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kymbelina79@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1266449951,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225680.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kymbelina","Id":225680,"Name":"Kymbelina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"313075236a5c68d2448a36511f4ff580","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mekanabr[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi ladies...I Finally heard from Beverly last week, thank goodness! It had only been 2 months! After I emailed her prob 5 times (bc I wanted to reserve my date and was getting anxious!) and my TA emailed the sales manager at the resort who also emailed Beverly...she finally got back to me.\n \n Here are a few things she told me:\n \n You can rent out the gazebo without the DJ for $250, just have to get the sound system set up seperatly (although I&#039;m not sure what that means..). Dinner doesn&#039;t start until 6:30, and she said you prob need 2 hrs for it (so renting the gazebo earlier than 8:30 doesn&#039;t really work). She also told me that they do not allow outside liquor to be served at the resort, so you cannot set up your own bar at the gazebo (you have to pay $15p\/p\/hr).\n \n The brochures that I had posted about previously came from the resort. My TA contacted them and they offered to send us a bunch. I&#039;ll try to scan it in tonight but I\"m not sure if the printer is unpacked yet! :)[\/quote] \n \n Kymbelina: according to this earlier message from mekanabr, she had heard from Beverly that the gazebo can be rented out for $250 without the services of the DJ...at least that was my understanding from it...I was also quoted $500 but that was for both the DJ and the Gazebo I believe!?  \n \n Quote: \n \n Originally Posted by [b]Kymbelina[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Missy, I was quoted $500 for the DJ and Beverly told me to bring my own CDs as well!  Like you said, what is the point of paying all that money when all he had to do is press a button?!?! \n \n As far as the restaurant.... I&#039;m still not sure if I&#039;m going to pay the $2500 to have it private.  What did Beverly tell you about the food options?  I&#039;m sooooo confused!  If I&#039;m correct, if it&#039;s semi-private, the food is no charge, but if you pay the $2500 to have it private, you have to pay for your food.  Does this make sense??  What has Beverly told you guys?   \n \n For that kind of money...pay me!!!  Ill press the stinkin button for my own wedding!!!!!\n \n Quote: \n \n Originally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n From the photos I really like the location of the Italian restaurant too! That&#039;s where we are probably having our reception dinner. Missy are you guys paying the extra $2500 for the private reception room?  \n \n \n According to Kerrij, a bride that got married down there...they did not pay the extra for the private room but said that it was plenty private in itself and they had theirs at the Italian restaurant.  But we definitely are not paying that kind of money for it either way.  That is way more than our AHR site is going to cost and that allows for dinner and dancing!!!  WAAAAYYYY too much money! \n \n Ashley - Where did you see pictures?????","Attachments":[],"Id":1248829,"PostDate":1281468683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mekanabr<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi ladies...I Finally heard from Beverly last week, thank goodness! It had only been 2 months! After I emailed her prob 5 times (bc I wanted to reserve my date and was getting anxious!) and my TA emailed the sales manager at the resort who also emailed Beverly...she finally got back to me.<br \/> <br \/> Here are a few things she told me:<br \/> <br \/> You can rent out the gazebo without the DJ for $250, just have to get the sound system set up seperatly (although I'm not sure what that means..). Dinner doesn't start until 6:30, and she said you prob need 2 hrs for it (so renting the gazebo earlier than 8:30 doesn't really work). She also told me that they do not allow outside liquor to be served at the resort, so you cannot set up your own bar at the gazebo (you have to pay $15p\/p\/hr).<br \/> <br \/> The brochures that I had posted about previously came from the resort. My TA contacted them and they offered to send us a bunch. I'll try to scan it in tonight but I\"m not sure if the printer is unpacked yet! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kymbelina: according to\u00a0this earlier message from mekanabr, she had heard from Beverly that the gazebo can be rented out for $250 without the services of the DJ...at least that was my understanding from it...I was also quoted $500 but that was for both the DJ and the Gazebo I believe!?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>Kymbelina<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Missy, I was quoted $500 for the DJ and Beverly told me to bring my own CDs as well!\u00a0 Like you said, what is the point of paying all that money when all he had to do is press a button?!?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As far as the restaurant.... I'm still not sure if I'm going to pay the $2500 to have it private.\u00a0 What did Beverly tell you about the food options?\u00a0 I'm sooooo confused!\u00a0 If I'm correct, if it's semi-private, the food is no charge, but if you pay the $2500 to have it private, you have to pay for your food.\u00a0 Does this make sense??\u00a0 What has Beverly told you guys?<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p> <br \/> For that kind of money...pay me!!!\u00a0 Ill press the stinkin button for my own wedding!!!!!<br \/> <br \/> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> From the photos I really like the location of the Italian restaurant too! That's where we are probably having our reception dinner. Missy are you guys paying the extra $2500 for the private reception room?<\/div> <\/div> <p> <br \/> <br \/> According to Kerrij, a bride that got married down there...they did not pay the extra for the private room but said that it was plenty private in itself and they had theirs at the Italian restaurant.\u00a0 But we definitely are not paying that kind of money for it either way.\u00a0 That is way\u00a0more than our AHR site is going to cost and that allows for dinner and dancing!!!\u00a0 WAAAAYYYY too much money!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ashley - Where did you see pictures?????<br \/> <span _fck_bookmark=\"1\"  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5cc03fe325eea764a3ac66ea7c7f469","RawContent":"Hey girls! I haven&#039;t had time to post in a while but welcome to all the new gbp brides! So exciting to have more on the forum.\n \n I totally agree about the dj, what&#039;s the point if I&#039;m bringing my own music anyway?? What songs are \"musts\" on your playlists?? Would love some suggestions!\n \n I found a great site to share with you all... www.oyster.com. they have reviews of hotels &amp; resorts and tons of pictures! Search for gbp and they have a great detailed review of everything at the resort and over 100 pics that you won&#039;t find on gbp&#039;s website...its amazing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1248884,"PostDate":1281469864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey girls! I haven't had time to post in a while but welcome to all the new gbp brides! So exciting to have more on the forum.<br> <br> I totally agree about the dj, what's the point if I'm bringing my own music anyway?? What songs are \"musts\" on your playlists?? Would love some suggestions!<br> <br> I found a great site to share with you all... www.oyster.com. they have reviews of hotels & resorts and tons of pictures! Search for gbp and they have a great detailed review of everything at the resort and over 100 pics that you won't find on gbp's website...its amazing!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2275446aa682c654439437f546803538","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks mekanabr!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m awasy hunting for more pics of the resort!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1248930,"PostDate":1281471243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks mekanabr!\u00a0 I'm awasy hunting for more pics of the resort!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76cbe4dacac885fc2501ec78137686aa","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mekanabr[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hey girls! I haven&#039;t had time to post in a while but welcome to all the new gbp brides! So exciting to have more on the forum.\n \n I totally agree about the dj, what&#039;s the point if I&#039;m bringing my own music anyway?? What songs are \"musts\" on your playlists?? Would love some suggestions!\n \n I found a great site to share with you all... www.oyster.com. they have reviews of hotels &amp;amp; resorts and tons of pictures! Search for gbp and they have a great detailed review of everything at the resort and over 100 pics that you won&#039;t find on gbp&#039;s website...its amazing![\/quote] \n \n \n How bizarre...I just used one of your past quotes and now poof...here you are!!  Were your ears ringing!??  lol! \n Thanks for that website...some really awesome pictures...I really want to see more people&#039;s wedding pics from there...those are the ones that I am obsessed with!!  Freakish thing though...I entered our dates to stay..and that website said that they don&#039;t have any availability!  Glad we aren&#039;t booking through them or I would be panicking! \n \n Ironically we were just starting to put together our song lists and there was one that came out in my Brides Magazine...has a lot of hit dance songs!  We are for sure playing: \n \n [size=3][font=calibri]Lady Gaga &amp;ndash; Just Dance\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [\/font][\/size][size=3][font=calibri]Usher &amp;ndash; Yeah[\/font][\/size] \n [size=3][font=calibri]Kylie Minogue &amp;ndash; Can&amp;rsquo;t Get You Outta My Head\t\t\t\t\t   [\/font][\/size][size=3][font=calibri]Gwen Stephani &amp;ndash; Sweet Escape[\/font][\/size] \n [size=3][font=calibri]Beyonce &amp;ndash; Single Ladies (Put a Ring on It)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  [\/font][\/size][size=3][font=calibri]B-52&amp;rsquo;s &amp;ndash; Love Shack[\/font][\/size] \n [size=3][font=calibri]Cindi Lauper &amp;ndash; Girls Just Wanna Have Fun\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  [\/font][\/size][size=3][font=calibri]Big &amp;amp; Rich &amp;ndash; Save a Horse, Ride a Cowboy[\/font][\/size] \n [size=3][font=calibri]Brian Setzer Orchestra &amp;ndash; Jump, Jive &amp;amp; Wail\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  [\/font][\/size][size=3][font=calibri]Lou Vega &amp;ndash; Mambo #5[\/font][\/size] \n [size=3][font=calibri]Kid Rock &amp;ndash; All Summer Long\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    [\/font][\/size][size=3][font=calibri]Lynard Skynard - Sweet Home Alabama[\/font][\/size] \n [size=3][font=calibri]Shakira &amp;ndash; Hips Don&amp;rsquo;t Lie\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  [\/font][\/size][size=3][font=calibri]Rhianna &amp;ndash; Don&amp;rsquo;t Stop the Music [\/font][\/size] \n \n \n But I have been kicking around the idea of bringing down a speaker docking system for the ipod...I dont know what they are going to have and I have not heard an answer on what exactly will be available if we don&#039;t use the DJ and if we have to pay to rent it, what is required to set it up...etc.!?  Do any of you ladies have any of those answers?! \n \n What are ya&#039;ll doing for flowers?  Have you decided?  Are we able to go with a different vendor other than the contracted Tia Floral or does that cost extra?","Attachments":[],"Id":1248938,"PostDate":1281471501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mekanabr<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hey girls! I haven't had time to post in a while but welcome to all the new gbp brides! So exciting to have more on the forum.<br \/> <br \/> I totally agree about the dj, what's the point if I'm bringing my own music anyway?? What songs are \"musts\" on your playlists?? Would love some suggestions!<br \/> <br \/> I found a great site to share with you all... www.oyster.com. they have reviews of hotels & resorts and tons of pictures! Search for gbp and they have a great detailed review of everything at the resort and over 100 pics that you won't find on gbp's website...its amazing!<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> How bizarre...I just used one of your past quotes and now poof...here you are!!\u00a0 Were your ears ringing!??\u00a0 lol!<\/p> <p> Thanks for that website...some really awesome pictures...I really want to see more people's wedding pics from there...those are the ones that I am obsessed with!!\u00a0 Freakish thing though...I entered our dates to stay..and that website said that they don't have any availability!\u00a0 Glad we aren't booking through them or I would be panicking!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ironically we were just starting to put together our song lists and there was one that came out in my Brides Magazine...has a lot of hit dance songs!\u00a0 We are for sure playing:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Lady Gaga \u2013 Just Dance\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Usher \u2013 Yeah<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Kylie Minogue \u2013 Can\u2019t Get You Outta My Head\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Gwen Stephani \u2013 Sweet Escape<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Beyonce \u2013 Single Ladies (Put a Ring on It)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">B-52\u2019s \u2013 Love Shack<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Cindi Lauper \u2013 Girls Just Wanna Have Fun\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Big & Rich \u2013 Save a Horse, Ride a Cowboy<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Brian Setzer Orchestra \u2013 Jump, Jive & Wail\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Lou Vega \u2013 Mambo #5<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Kid Rock \u2013 All Summer Long\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Lynard Skynard - Sweet Home Alabama<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Shakira \u2013 Hips Don\u2019t Lie\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Rhianna \u2013 Don\u2019t Stop the Music\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But I have been kicking around the idea of bringing down a speaker docking system for the ipod...I dont know what they are going to have and I have not heard an answer on what exactly will be available if we don't use the DJ and if we have to pay to rent it, what is required to set it up...etc.!?\u00a0 Do any of you ladies have any of those answers?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are ya'll doing for flowers?\u00a0 Have you decided?\u00a0 Are we able to go with a different vendor other than the contracted Tia Floral or does that cost extra?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc75b616c65f17b72f8f0bdcc7029eed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I don&#039;t know what I&#039;m going to do about flowers.&amp;nbsp; I haven&#039;t seen the ones that are included in the wedding package, and I&#039;m not very picky and I love most tropical flowers, so I&#039;m holding out hope that they are nice, I asked Beverly for pics but she didn&#039;t get back to me.&amp;nbsp; Does anybody know waht the resort flowers look like?&amp;nbsp; The only flowers we&#039;re doing is bout&#039;s for the boys, and bouquets for me and my mom, other then that I&#039;m not going to do any other flowers.&amp;nbsp; What about you ladies?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1248986,"PostDate":1281473110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I don't know what I'm going to do about flowers.\u00a0 I haven't seen the ones that are included in the wedding package, and I'm not very picky and I love most tropical flowers, so I'm holding out hope that they are nice, I asked Beverly for pics but she didn't get back to me.\u00a0 Does anybody know waht the resort flowers look like?\u00a0 The only flowers we're doing is bout's for the boys, and bouquets for me and my mom, other then that I'm not going to do any other flowers.\u00a0 What about you ladies?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0df5d28bbc2a358b84191f8ce148f1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;7512&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Quote.xlsx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;73&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;xlsx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The file is too large to upload but i have their catalog that they sent me; there are 2 different ones.&amp;nbsp; One of the bouquets and one of the decorations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I attached my quote from them...I think they are very pricey!&amp;nbsp; I found a girl on Craigslist and actually she had&amp;nbsp;our colors in her bouquets and she had the amount&amp;nbsp;I needed so I bought the silk ones for the bridal party.&amp;nbsp; We are making all the&amp;nbsp;flowers for the guys...I am hoping to maybe have a fresh one for me made to closely resemble the ones from the BM&#039;s and if not, I have a larger one that matches theirs for mine that I will use.  I know that different things that are included in your packages at the GBP can be shifted and moved to upgrade or change things...so I think I will try that...HATE the idea of leaving all those details until we get down there though!!!&amp;nbsp; I thought about sending Tia Floral a pic of the bouquet and asking if they can duplicate it with real flowers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1249111,"PostDate":1281477007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7512\",\"name\":\"Quote.xlsx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"73\",\"type\":\"xlsx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The file is too large to upload but i have their catalog that they sent me; there are 2 different ones.\u00a0 One of the bouquets and one of the decorations.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I attached my quote from them...I think they are very pricey!\u00a0 I found a girl on Craigslist and actually she had\u00a0our colors in her bouquets and she had the amount\u00a0I needed so I bought the silk ones for the bridal party.\u00a0 We are making all the\u00a0flowers for the guys...I am hoping to maybe have a fresh one for me made to closely resemble the ones from the BM's and if not, I have a larger one that matches theirs for mine that I will use.\u00a0\u00a0I know that different things that are included in your packages at the GBP can be shifted and moved to upgrade or change things...so I think I will try that...HATE the idea of leaving all those details until we get down there though!!!\u00a0 I thought about sending Tia Floral a pic of the bouquet and asking if they can duplicate it with real flowers.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df97e5b5d40908cc9d4fa64443350744","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Damn I still don&#039;t have access privledges, I am 40 posts away.&amp;nbsp; Was that a catalogue of the flowers for Bahia?&amp;nbsp; Does it include the basic flowers in the wedding package?&amp;nbsp; Did you get it from Bev?&amp;nbsp; So jealous, I&#039;m goign to email her again right now.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1249228,"PostDate":1281481138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Damn I still don't have access privledges, I am 40 posts away.\u00a0 Was that a catalogue of the flowers for Bahia?\u00a0 Does it include the basic flowers in the wedding package?\u00a0 Did you get it from Bev?\u00a0 So jealous, I'm goign to email her again right now.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"621593efc6ef7f8a49fd502f86766baa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks for posting this,...I was also wondering about flowers. So Im guessing when we get down there we will choose all the flowers when we meet with Beverly?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What are you all doing about centre pieces, I was going to do vases with floating flowers but the thought of bringing down the vases gives me a headache...I am trying to think if there is anything I can get down there.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1249253,"PostDate":1281482614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks for posting this,...I was also wondering about flowers. So Im guessing when we get down there we will choose all the flowers when we meet with Beverly?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are you all doing about centre pieces, I was going to do vases with floating flowers but the thought of bringing down the vases gives me a headache...I am trying to think if there is anything I can get down there.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":220,"NextPage":230,"PreviousPage":210,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
