Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ac1449adc316cec69117db9b09a1a64","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi soon to be Mrs Dow,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m glad you were able to see the pics..Thanks! &amp;nbsp;Guess I downloaded them right!! lol!&amp;nbsp; I think they do always do the cake, and everything&amp;nbsp;right after, but I&#039;m sure if you wanted it different that wouldn&#039;t be a prob!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1250681,"PostDate":1281564139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi soon to be Mrs Dow,<\/p> <p> \u00c2\u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm glad you were able to see the pics..Thanks! \u00a0Guess I downloaded them right!! lol!\u00a0 I think they do always do the cake, and everything\u00a0right after, but I'm sure if you wanted it different that wouldn't be a prob!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joelleschiliro@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1259831042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223693.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JMarie","Id":223693,"Name":"JMarie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a2c9a777edc8fd02507285106238f06","RawContent":"\n\n&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;missy&amp;eric2011&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img style=\"border: 0px solid;\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;\n\n\n\n&lt;p&gt;\n\nI haven&#039;t even thought about bringing down decorations!  Are you bringing down a cake topper too?!  I already planned to bring down the jars for the sand ceremony...geez...I am going to end up bringing everything but the kitchen sink!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have read other comments from ladies on the site that Tia is Waaaay more expensive than the other vendors in the area.  My quote was originally for $3000 and I thought that was ridiculous; not to mention they were very unfriendly to deal with!  But I think that price is even worse when it&#039;s impossible to take them home and enjoy them after the wedding!  I think I am going to do some checking and see who else is in that area as a vendor. &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;sorry...I sound negative...Refresh....Wedding...In Jamaica....Okay...I&#039;m better!  &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"44\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"66\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\n\n \n You can try checking out floral fantasies for your flowers. I read about them in another post somewhere on here, but I think they were much cheaper than tai. Try searching for a tai floral thread that might be where I saw it. If I find it I&#039;ll post it cuz I think there was more than one vendor in that area.\n \n Also I know their are tons of sellers on etsy that make real touch bouquets and bouts. I saw a cute idea for a bout that was peacock feathers (depends on your wedding colours I guess). I also thought the starfish bouts were cute.","Attachments":[],"Id":1250746,"PostDate":1281566723,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br><br><div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>&nbsp;<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' style=\"border: 0px solid;\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br><br><br><br><p><br><br>I haven't even thought about bringing down decorations!\u00a0 Are you bringing down a cake topper too?!\u00a0 I already planned to bring down the jars for the sand ceremony...geez...I am going to end up bringing everything but the kitchen sink!!!!<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>I have read other comments from ladies on the site that Tia is Waaaay more expensive than the other vendors in the area.\u00a0 My quote was originally for $3000 and I thought that was ridiculous; not to mention they were very unfriendly to deal with!\u00a0 But I think that price is\u00a0even worse\u00a0when it's impossible to take them home and enjoy them after the wedding!\u00a0 I think I am going to do some checking and see who else is in that area as a vendor.\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>sorry...I sound negative...Refresh....Wedding...In Jamaica....Okay...I'm better!\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"44\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"66\"><\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div><br><br><br> <br> You can try checking out floral fantasies for your flowers. I read about them in another post somewhere on here, but I think they were much cheaper than tai. Try searching for a tai floral thread that might be where I saw it. If I find it I'll post it cuz I think there was more than one vendor in that area.<br> <br> Also I know their are tons of sellers on etsy that make real touch bouquets and bouts. I saw a cute idea for a bout that was peacock feathers (depends on your wedding colours I guess). I also thought the starfish bouts were cute.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf8bab0bb9b5ac9cd18ed8f9c4ff9858","RawContent":"I bought a TTD dress from le chateau for $20 lol. Not what I would want to walk down the aisle in, but if I&#039;m rolling around in the sand It will work. It&#039;s long, and white, see through satin. eek! Might need to get a slip or liner sewn into it. \n \n That&#039;s a great idea to do the TTD the day of your hair trial (if you aren&#039;t wearing the dress later on). I&#039;m still torn about changing for the reception. If I do it will definitely be into another white dress. At my friends DW she just changed into a random sun dress and didn&#039;t look like I bride at all anymore. I wanna be treated like a bride as long as possible lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1250753,"PostDate":1281567122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I bought a TTD dress from le chateau for $20 lol. Not what I would want to walk down the aisle in, but if I'm rolling around in the sand It will work. It's long, and white, see through satin. eek! Might need to get a slip or liner sewn into it. <br> <br> That's a great idea to do the TTD the day of your hair trial (if you aren't wearing the dress later on). I'm still torn about changing for the reception. If I do it will definitely be into another white dress. At my friends DW she just changed into a random sun dress and didn't look like I bride at all anymore. I wanna be treated like a bride as long as possible lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d5a45308ae029392882cc2c017c8187","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; love reading these posts ladies!&amp;nbsp; i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; other than that, we&#039;re really excited!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1250798,"PostDate":1281568703,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> love reading these posts ladies!\u00a0 i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK!<\/p> <p> other than that, we're really excited!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daphnetorgal@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275444609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daphne","Id":228753,"Name":"daphne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c570c3099b2a9f75c906d07e8f1df29","RawContent":"\n\n&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;daphne&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img style=\"border: 0px solid;\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;\n love reading these posts ladies!&amp;nbsp; i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK!&lt;\/p&gt;\n &lt;p&gt;\n other than that, we&#039;re really excited!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\n\n \n We just bought fi&#039;s suit from tip top tailors. It&#039;s a tan Calvin Klein and on sale! Also La Chareau has some nice summery mens stuff. Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1250827,"PostDate":1281569863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br><br><div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>daphne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' style=\"border: 0px solid;\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br><br><p><br> love reading these posts ladies!\u00a0 i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK!<\/p><br> <p><br> other than that, we're really excited!<\/p><\/div><\/div><br><br><br> <br> We just bought fi's suit from tip top tailors. It's a tan Calvin Klein and on sale! Also La Chareau has some nice summery mens stuff. Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41c10ea4ba3638a30c9f584c163bbc59","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I bought a TTD dress from le chateau for $20 lol. Not what I would want to walk down the aisle in, but if I&#039;m rolling around in the sand It will work. It&#039;s long, and white, see through satin. eek! Might need to get a slip or liner sewn into it.\n \n That&#039;s a great idea to do the TTD the day of your hair trial (if you aren&#039;t wearing the dress later on). I&#039;m still torn about changing for the reception. If I do it will definitely be into another white dress. At my friends DW she just changed into a random sun dress and didn&#039;t look like I bride at all anymore. I wanna be treated like a bride as long as possible lol.[\/quote] \n Agreed, great idea on the hair trial.  I dont know if I want a TTD pics yet, I still need to find a cheap dress for them if I do! \n \n I want to be treated like a bride as long as possible too, hahaha, which is why I&#039;m still contemplating to get a second.  I could get a white cocktail type dress, there is a super cute one at BCBG I&#039;ve been dreaming about for a while, but Im very indecisive!","Attachments":[],"Id":1251382,"PostDate":1281628673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I bought a TTD dress from le chateau for $20 lol. Not what I would want to walk down the aisle in, but if I'm rolling around in the sand It will work. It's long, and white, see through satin. eek! Might need to get a slip or liner sewn into it.<br \/> <br \/> That's a great idea to do the TTD the day of your hair trial (if you aren't wearing the dress later on). I'm still torn about changing for the reception. If I do it will definitely be into another white dress. At my friends DW she just changed into a random sun dress and didn't look like I bride at all anymore. I wanna be treated like a bride as long as possible lol.<\/blockquote> <p> Agreed, great idea on the hair trial.\u00a0 I dont know if I want a TTD pics yet, I still need to find a cheap dress for them if I do!<\/p> <p> <br \/> I want to be treated like a bride as long as possible too, hahaha, which is why I'm still contemplating to get a second.\u00a0 I could get a white cocktail type dress, there is a super cute one at BCBG I've been dreaming about for a while, but Im very indecisive!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"848c14fc89eb17e13e7e781d73c199f7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n We just bought fi&#039;s suit from tip top tailors. It&#039;s a tan Calvin Klein and on sale! Also La Chareau has some nice summery mens stuff. Good luck![\/quote] \n \n And then I read down more and had more to say, hahahaha.  Tiptop is agreat place for suits, I still dont&#039; know if I want my FI to have a suit jacket, or just pants and a shirt.  I guess I need to try them on him to see.  And I tried Le Chateau but he said he woudln&#039;t go in there, hahahahaa, so I&#039;ll try tiptop I guess!   They do have a really nice Calvin Kline line, so I think we&#039;ll try that out.","Attachments":[],"Id":1251386,"PostDate":1281628750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> We just bought fi's suit from tip top tailors. It's a tan Calvin Klein and on sale! Also La Chareau has some nice summery mens stuff. Good luck!<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> And then I read down more and had more to say, hahahaha.\u00a0 Tiptop is agreat place for suits, I still dont' know if I want my FI to have a suit jacket, or just pants and a shirt.\u00a0 I guess I need to try them on him to see.\u00a0 And I tried Le Chateau but he said he woudln't go in there, hahahahaa, so I'll try tiptop I guess!\u00a0\u00a0 They do have a really nice Calvin Kline line, so I think we'll try that out.\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c8f63a9e4d6fad2c6d9e1781878ee64","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I bought a TTD dress from le chateau for $20 lol. Not what I would want to walk down the aisle in, but if I&#039;m rolling around in the sand It will work. It&#039;s long, and white, see through satin. eek! Might need to get a slip or liner sewn into it.\n \n That&#039;s a great idea to do the TTD the day of your hair trial (if you aren&#039;t wearing the dress later on). I&#039;m still torn about changing for the reception. If I do it will definitely be into another white dress. At my friends DW she just changed into a random sun dress and didn&#039;t look like I bride at all anymore. I wanna be treated like a bride as long as possible lol.[\/quote] \n \n I don&#039;t know how \"trashed\" the dress gets after, but figure I better play it safe and do it the day after...hopefully it doesn&#039;t get too \"trashed\" partying either!  But I totally want to be a bride as long as possible too and I want more than the people down there with us to take note of it!  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif[\/img] \n   \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]daphne[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n love reading these posts ladies!  i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK! \n other than that, we&#039;re really excited![\/quote] \n \n \n We got really nice linen suits for the guys at Herbergers...the pants were $30 and the jackets were $98; my FI, his dad and my dad are wearing jackets and the rest of the guys are not; as of yet, we still have to find some nice white shirts though.  We still have to find my FI TTD outfit, too though!  hehehehe  For you ladies doing a TTD shoot, what is your FI wearing??  (Eric can&#039;t wear his suit b\/c we are having an AHR that he will be wearing it again for.)","Attachments":[],"Id":1251506,"PostDate":1281632480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I bought a TTD dress from le chateau for $20 lol. Not what I would want to walk down the aisle in, but if I'm rolling around in the sand It will work. It's long, and white, see through satin. eek! Might need to get a slip or liner sewn into it.<br \/> <br \/> That's a great idea to do the TTD the day of your hair trial (if you aren't wearing the dress later on). I'm still torn about changing for the reception. If I do it will definitely be into another white dress. At my friends DW she just changed into a random sun dress and didn't look like I bride at all anymore. I wanna be treated like a bride as long as possible lol.<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> I don't know how \"trashed\" the dress gets after, but figure I better play it safe and do it the day after...hopefully it doesn't get too \"trashed\" partying either!\u00a0 But I totally want to be a bride as long as possible too and I want more than the people down there with us to take note of it!\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"27\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"42\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>daphne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> love reading these posts ladies!\u00a0 i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK!<\/p> <p> other than that, we're really excited!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> We got really nice linen suits for the guys at Herbergers...the pants were $30 and the jackets were $98; my FI, his dad and my dad are wearing jackets and the rest of the guys are not; as of yet, we still have to find some nice white shirts though.\u00a0 We still have to find\u00a0my FI\u00a0TTD outfit, too though!\u00a0 hehehehe\u00a0 For you ladies doing a TTD shoot, what is your FI wearing??\u00a0 (Eric can't wear his suit b\/c we are having an AHR that he will be wearing it again for.)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cb9f29023df23e1f8e3806f514dd785","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]daphne[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n love reading these posts ladies!  i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK! \n other than that, we&#039;re really excited![\/quote] \n \n \n Same boat as you, but with everyone except me! lol. We&#039;re only having a best man so him and my fi are planning to start looking in sept...and my bridesmaids have been looking for over 2 months and we can&#039;t find anything...hopefully they all find something soon! lol \n   \n   \n For those of you not being able to see the pics, i had to click on them to download them because they wouldn&#039;t load so maybe try that!","Attachments":[],"Id":1251838,"PostDate":1281643621,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>daphne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> love reading these posts ladies!\u00a0 i have 3 months to go and a groom with no suit!!! EEEK!<\/p> <p> other than that, we're really excited!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Same boat as you, but with everyone except me! lol.\u00a0We're only having a best man so him and my fi are planning to start looking in sept...and my bridesmaids have been looking for over 2 months and we can't find anything...hopefully they all find something soon! lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For those of you not being able to see the pics, i had to click on them to download them because they wouldn't load so maybe try that!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;46;23\/st\/20110111\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/16e1\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...16e1\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sara.willy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1259221185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223542.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soontobemrsdow","Id":223542,"Name":"soontobemrsdow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd51d1a28164ca5e4a92b6955ba80df2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Just got an email stating my BM dresses are on the truck to be delivered today!!!&amp;nbsp; I soooo can&#039;t wait to see them!!!!&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"33\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"225\" \/&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1252696,"PostDate":1281716521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong>Just got an email stating my BM dresses are on the truck to be delivered today!!!\u00a0 I soooo can't wait to see them!!!!\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"33\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"225\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":250,"NextPage":260,"PreviousPage":240,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
