{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2fa805391adae0af5b1bdddd6ad45a0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; AshleyL - checked Lechateau and love their suit, but they dont have his size anywhere!!!&amp;nbsp; and the price was very reasonable....they have the pants 2 sizes to big and now im wondering if we can have them altered to his size....hmmmm&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; missy&amp;amp;eric2011 - im in canada....we have very limited stuff here - or at least i just have bad luck!&amp;nbsp; Thats an amazing deal!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/missy%26eric2011\"&gt; &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; soontobemrsdow - good luck and keep hunting!&amp;nbsp; you&#039;ll find something soon enough thats perfect :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253137,"PostDate":1281729442,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> AshleyL - checked Lechateau and love their suit, but they dont have his size anywhere!!!\u00a0 and the price was very reasonable....they have the pants 2 sizes to big and now im wondering if we can have them altered to his size....hmmmm<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> missy&eric2011 - im in canada....we have very limited stuff here - or at least i just have bad luck!\u00a0 Thats an amazing deal!!!<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/missy%26eric2011' class='bbc_url' title=''> <\/a><\/p> <p> soontobemrsdow - good luck and keep hunting!\u00a0 you'll find something soon enough thats perfect <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daphnetorgal@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275444609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daphne","Id":228753,"Name":"daphne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f3ad653b7844ae9005081904dd786bd","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]missy&amp;amp;eric2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [b]Just got an email stating my BM dresses are on the truck to be delivered today!!!  I soooo can&#039;t wait to see them!!!!  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif[\/img][\/b][\/quote] \n \n \n yay!  sooo exciting!!  What do they look like!?","Attachments":[],"Id":1253348,"PostDate":1281738545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <strong>Just got an email stating my BM dresses are on the truck to be delivered today!!!\u00a0 I soooo can't wait to see them!!!!\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"33\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"225\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> yay!\u00a0 sooo exciting!!\u00a0 What do they look like!?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04299270e0f3376387774ab64ee82c1e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Okay, so my travel agent said that all the rooms are ocean view at the Bahia.&amp;nbsp; So I believed her and was just reading a view on tripadvisor and it said that you have to request an ocean view.&amp;nbsp; And on my bill it just says ocean suite from my TA.&amp;nbsp; So what gives?   Anybody know differently?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253470,"PostDate":1281750407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Okay, so my travel agent said that all the rooms are ocean view at the Bahia.\u00a0 So I believed her and was just reading a view on tripadvisor and it said that you have to request an ocean view.\u00a0 And on my bill it just says ocean suite from my TA.\u00a0 So what gives?\u00a0\u00a0 Anybody know differently?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed88f6346348427af693761297f7aeac","RawContent":"Akua420 do you know if your group is booked in the Royal Golden section? If they are then yes all the rooms should be ocean view suites. We chose to upgrade to the golden section, but since it was $100 more we gave our guests the option to upgrade or not. Not all rooms are ocean view though.","Attachments":[],"Id":1253535,"PostDate":1281757781,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Akua420 do you know if your group is booked in the Royal Golden section? If they are then yes all the rooms should be ocean view suites. We chose to upgrade to the golden section, but since it was $100 more we gave our guests the option to upgrade or not. Not all rooms are ocean view though.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4fe9e6f2288d1b41ffc53318bd92c4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Erin!&amp;nbsp; Thanks for all the info, its always helpful having someone who has actually been to the resort before!&amp;nbsp; I know you were talking about a map, where did you find it (or if you have a copy from the resort, could you attach it here?)&amp;nbsp; I&#039;d love to figure out the layout but haven&#039;t been able to find a map yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Did you see other weddings there?&amp;nbsp; If so, what did you think?&amp;nbsp; Any suggestions or heads up for us of anything that we should know (wedding or just about the resort in general).&amp;nbsp; That is awesome news about the snorkeling, my fiance and I love to snorkel and I was worried about that!&amp;nbsp; Did you do any excursions around the island when you were there?&amp;nbsp; We wanted to take everyone on a sunset cruise or something like that but aren&#039;t sure yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks for your help and congrats on your upcoming wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253685,"PostDate":1281798094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Erin!\u00a0 Thanks for all the info, its always helpful having someone who has actually been to the resort before!\u00a0 I know you were talking about a map, where did you find it (or if you have a copy from the resort, could you attach it here?)\u00a0 I'd love to figure out the layout but haven't been able to find a map yet.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Did you see other weddings there?\u00a0 If so, what did you think?\u00a0 Any suggestions or heads up for us of anything that we should know (wedding or just about the resort in general).\u00a0 That is awesome news about the snorkeling, my fiance and I love to snorkel and I was worried about that!\u00a0 Did you do any excursions around the island when you were there?\u00a0 We wanted to take everyone on a sunset cruise or something like that but aren't sure yet.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for your help and congrats on your upcoming wedding!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e6398fee49256bc9b46acffa90be736","RawContent":"I found the map by joining a facebook group on the Gran Bahia thats pretty cool. I have added it below, I actually included it on a full page in the pre travel brochure we are giving people in January. \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mekanabr[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Erin!  Thanks for all the info, its always helpful having someone who has actually been to the resort before!  I know you were talking about a map, where did you find it (or if you have a copy from the resort, could you attach it here?)  I&#039;d love to figure out the layout but haven&#039;t been able to find a map yet.  \n   \n Did you see other weddings there?  If so, what did you think?  Any suggestions or heads up for us of anything that we should know (wedding or just about the resort in general).  That is awesome news about the snorkeling, my fiance and I love to snorkel and I was worried about that!  Did you do any excursions around the island when you were there?  We wanted to take everyone on a sunset cruise or something like that but aren&#039;t sure yet.  \n   \n Thanks for your help and congrats on your upcoming wedding!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[{"Id":20327,"Name":"gbj.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-26846-138622101874.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-26846-138622101874_thumb.jpg","Width":604,"Height":433}],"Id":1253759,"PostDate":1281811209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I found the map by joining a facebook group on the Gran Bahia thats pretty cool. I have added it below, I actually included it on a full page in the pre travel brochure we are giving people in January.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7572\",\"name\":\"gbj.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"60\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mekanabr<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Erin!\u00a0 Thanks for all the info, its always helpful having someone who has actually been to the resort before!\u00a0 I know you were talking about a map, where did you find it (or if you have a copy from the resort, could you attach it here?)\u00a0 I'd love to figure out the layout but haven't been able to find a map yet.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Did you see other weddings there?\u00a0 If so, what did you think?\u00a0 Any suggestions or heads up for us of anything that we should know (wedding or just about the resort in general).\u00a0 That is awesome news about the snorkeling, my fiance and I love to snorkel and I was worried about that!\u00a0 Did you do any excursions around the island when you were there?\u00a0 We wanted to take everyone on a sunset cruise or something like that but aren't sure yet.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for your help and congrats on your upcoming wedding!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f080cb54c9d37c6c5bd1cc806152cda","RawContent":"Thanks Katelynn. I have been searching for a map. Thanks too for the info on the facebook group. I&#039;ll have to look into that.","Attachments":[],"Id":1253777,"PostDate":1281814518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Katelynn. I have been searching for a map. Thanks too for the info on the facebook group. I'll have to look into that.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97a0dc86e3ee3d0f690e41cbd2905c1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n \n  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;pagefoster&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Yes, have a look at who you&#039;re booked with (tour operator) and check the room category.. If you&#039;re booked with Transat then ALL their rooms are club golden, if you&#039;re booked with Sunquest I believe they have an option to upgrade to Golden.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Are you sure transat offers only royal golden because this is who we booked with and they still gave us the regular room and royal golden as seperate prices. But just like AshleyL said fit was a $100pp difference so just like her, we&#039;re letting our guests decide which one they want. I&#039;m kinda confused now...lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253885,"PostDate":1281831874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <span>Quote:<\/span> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>pagefoster<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Yes, have a look at who you're booked with (tour operator) and check the room category.. If you're booked with Transat then ALL their rooms are club golden, if you're booked with Sunquest I believe they have an option to upgrade to Golden.<\/p> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Are you sure transat offers only royal golden because this is who we booked with and they still gave us the regular room and royal golden as seperate prices. But just like AshleyL said fit was a $100pp difference so just like her, we're letting our guests decide which one they want. I'm kinda confused now...lol<\/p> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;46;23\/st\/20110111\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/16e1\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...16e1\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sara.willy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1259221185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223542.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soontobemrsdow","Id":223542,"Name":"soontobemrsdow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60838edc1ec44971c3679b276b0febd4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; just wondering if anyone has used the resorts photographer and what their prices are like?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1254631,"PostDate":1281963548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> just wondering if anyone has used the resorts photographer and what their prices are like?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tishaboo05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281447462,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231209.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tish","Id":231209,"Name":"tish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43651fc5929c0128a542a5c37034336a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m interested in the photographer too!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just heard back from Bev and she showed me the flowers included in the wedding package.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m glad I saw them now because I hate them and am going to order my flowers from a cheaper florist off site.&amp;nbsp; I want pink flowers, not red and yellow!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"flowers.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/123477\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1254771,"PostDate":1281971028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm interested in the photographer too!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just heard back from Bev and she showed me the flowers included in the wedding package.\u00a0 I'm glad I saw them now because I hate them and am going to order my flowers from a cheaper florist off site.\u00a0 I want pink flowers, not red and yellow!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"flowers.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/123477\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":260,"NextPage":270,"PreviousPage":250,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
