{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de5b7bb5d5d40bdb8a9ad4b3247ace46","RawContent":"I know Kerrij said somewhere on here that they brought their own photographer and also used the resorts photog for the 10 free pics in their package. I remember reading that she wasn&#039;t impressesed with him. Also the prices for photographer are all in the wedding package Beverly sent to me. I. I know the wedding package has been posted on here before and I&#039;m on my iPad and it&#039;s saved on my home comp, so I can&#039;t post it right now. Try searching for it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1254800,"PostDate":1281971801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know Kerrij said somewhere on here that they brought their own photographer and also used the resorts photog for the 10 free pics in their package. I remember reading that she wasn't impressesed with him. Also the prices for photographer are all in the wedding package Beverly sent to me. I. I know the wedding package has been posted on here before and I'm on my iPad and it's saved on my home comp, so I can't post it right now. Try searching for it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"966ee4eb93e2c82217c2b40ac3a4b80a","RawContent":"Here are our BM dresses...except my MOH and my FI 2 daughters (JR BM) will be in Fuchsia, with a tangerine ruffle, and our other 4 BM will be in Tangerine with the Fuchsia ruffle.  It is hard to see it in the pic but there is a row of crystals that runs down the bodice and connects to the ruffles...when my bonus daughters tried them on Friday...the crystals were sparkling just from the lights in the kitchen!  Can&#039;t wait to see how gorgeous they are going to be in the Jamaican sunlight!!!  I am very happy with how they turned out! Especially for never seeing them in person!!!  :)\n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/123582\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mekanabr[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n \n \n yay!  sooo exciting!!  What do they look like!?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1254827,"PostDate":1281973092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here are our BM dresses...except my MOH and my FI 2 daughters (JR BM) will be in Fuchsia, with a tangerine ruffle, and our other 4 BM will be in Tangerine with the Fuchsia ruffle.\u00a0 It is hard to see it in the pic but there is a row of crystals that runs down the bodice and connects to the ruffles...when my bonus daughters tried them on Friday...the crystals were sparkling just from the lights in the kitchen!\u00a0 Can't wait to see how gorgeous they are going to be in the Jamaican sunlight!!!\u00a0 I am very happy with how they turned out! Especially for never seeing them in person!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Forever Yours Dress.jpg\" height=\"399\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/123582\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 385px; height: 437px\" width=\"220\" \/><\/span><\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mekanabr<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> <br \/> yay!\u00a0 sooo exciting!!\u00a0 What do they look like!?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7807ac0bee42cf2d65ebcb63104a006e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; How far in advance did everyone book the resort ? we are looking to get married October 2011 at the GBP !!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1255239,"PostDate":1281987251,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> How far in advance did everyone book the resort ? we are looking to get married October 2011 at the GBP !!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><em>October 18, 2011 Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay Jamaica<\/em><br><em>I married my bestfriend with 60 of our closest family and friends<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>and I would do it all over again <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"v_makel@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281111200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231088.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"toesinsand30","Id":231088,"Name":"toesinsand30","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4c7bb502ae3bf1efbe46a75111114d8","RawContent":"We are also flying with Transat and you have a choice b\/t regular and Royal Golden and its about a $100 price difference. We gave all of our guests the option and so far everyone is going with golden and we have about 25 booked right now.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]soontobemrsdow[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n  [\/quote] \n \n \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]tish[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n just wondering if anyone has used the resorts photographer and what their prices are like?[\/quote] \n \n Someone said here too - maybe Kerri that if you bring your own photographer you can talk to Beverly and maybe get something else in return - ie free flowers for a BM so I am deff going to try this and Ill let you know how it goes!","Attachments":[],"Id":1255320,"PostDate":1281989999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are also flying with Transat and you have a choice b\/t regular and Royal Golden and its about a $100 price difference. We gave all of our guests the option and so far everyone is going with golden and we have about 25 booked right now.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>soontobemrsdow<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>tish<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> just wondering if anyone has used the resorts photographer and what their prices are like?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Someone said here too - maybe Kerri that if you bring your own photographer you can talk to Beverly and maybe get something else in return - ie free flowers for a BM so I am deff going to try this and Ill let you know how it goes!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0ff4ceeac89fda2332a704b24f6958e","RawContent":"I was also looking and there was nothing I saw that I liked. Someone else on here said Tai flora was really expensive so I did some investigating and found an amazing flower shop - however I just found out its in Negril!!!  :( way too far away. What is everyone else doing for flowers now as I am a bit lost...\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]akua420[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m interested in the photographer too! \n   \n I just heard back from Bev and she showed me the flowers included in the wedding package.  I&#039;m glad I saw them now because I hate them and am going to order my flowers from a cheaper florist off site.  I want pink flowers, not red and yellow!!! \n   \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/123477\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1255332,"PostDate":1281990194,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I was also looking and there was nothing I saw that I liked. Someone else on here said Tai flora was really expensive so I did some investigating and found an amazing flower shop - however I just found out its in Negril!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> way too far away. What is everyone else doing for flowers now as I am a bit lost...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>akua420<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm interested in the photographer too!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just heard back from Bev and she showed me the flowers included in the wedding package.\u00a0 I'm glad I saw them now because I hate them and am going to order my flowers from a cheaper florist off site.\u00a0 I want pink flowers, not red and yellow!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"flowers.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/123477\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6fc95db4d208fb18eee6e4015a5e50ee","RawContent":"We booked about a year in advance but we had to go a specific week as I am in between semesters for school and we wanted to give our guests lots of time to save the money.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]toesinsand30[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n How far in advance did everyone book the resort ? we are looking to get married October 2011 at the GBP !![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1255335,"PostDate":1281990276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We booked about a year in advance but we had to go a specific week as I am in between semesters for school and we wanted to give our guests lots of time to save the money.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>toesinsand30<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> How far in advance did everyone book the resort ? we are looking to get married October 2011 at the GBP !!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef5f02a1ace8b1f0aecbe777b9a9e1c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i emailed beverly this morning and she emailed right back! i was shocked lol she sent me prices for the photographers packages, if anyones interested send me a msg and ill send you the link :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1255391,"PostDate":1281991992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i emailed beverly this morning and she emailed right back! i was shocked lol she sent me prices for the photographers packages, if anyones interested send me a msg and ill send you the link <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tishaboo05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281447462,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231209.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tish","Id":231209,"Name":"tish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1d74c2a4432717ea735ce6d5adda612","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We booked ours as soon as the prices came out...we knew we wanted to get married in May so we were ready....our TA said that if the majority of people are booked with their deposits&amp;nbsp;by October we will be in good shape; the remainder of their money will be due in March.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1255490,"PostDate":1281994927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We booked ours as soon as the prices came out...we knew we wanted to get married in May so we were ready....our TA said that if the majority of people are booked with their deposits\u00a0by October we will be in good shape; the remainder of their money will be due in March.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a4c03bcfb8f35431f932343234e379b","RawContent":"I have no idea what we are going to do other than I am for sure having silk flowers for everyone who is having\/carrying\/wearing flowers.  Beyond that...I have no idea as far as the decorations.  I do want flowers on the gazebo, but if the money in the package will go farther with another company...I def. want to explore that option! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]katelynn[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n I was also looking and there was nothing I saw that I liked. Someone else on here said Tai flora was really expensive so I did some investigating and found an amazing flower shop - however I just found out its in Negril!!!  :( way too far away. What is everyone else doing for flowers now as I am a bit lost...\n   \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1255497,"PostDate":1281995033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> I have no idea what we are going to do other than I am for sure having silk flowers for everyone who is having\/carrying\/wearing flowers.\u00a0 Beyond that...I have no idea as far as the decorations.\u00a0 I do want flowers on the gazebo, but if the money in the package will go farther with another company...I def. want to explore that option!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>katelynn<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> I was also looking and there was nothing I saw that I liked. Someone else on here said Tai flora was really expensive so I did some investigating and found an amazing flower shop - however I just found out its in Negril!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> way too far away. What is everyone else doing for flowers now as I am a bit lost...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"407162698683e1a58177ca82a0a3149e","RawContent":"Who was in charge of playing the music for this part?  Did you have them on a CD\/Ipod....what did they have set up for you? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JMarie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=1][font=calibri]\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 During this time you do your first dances, parent dances, garter toss and bouquet toss! Make sure you request an extra bouquet to toss,  I used one of my bridesmaids or maybe just bring a fake one from home to toss..) you never see it again!  You also cut your cake at this time!  It may sound a little funny but trust me it all works so wonderfully![\/font][\/size] \n   \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1255506,"PostDate":1281995184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Who was in charge of playing the\u00a0music for this part?\u00a0 Did you have them on a CD\/Ipod....what did they have set up for you?<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JMarie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: medium\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 During this time you do your first dances, parent dances, garter toss and bouquet toss! Make sure you request an extra bouquet to toss, \u00a0I used one of my bridesmaids or maybe just bring a fake one from home to toss..) you never see it again!\u00a0 You also cut your cake at this time!\u00a0 It may sound a little funny but trust me it all works so wonderfully!<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":270,"NextPage":280,"PreviousPage":260,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
