{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69f3c59cd21f7c990e0ec1fedd620465","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks guys!!&amp;nbsp; Mekanbar, no dumb questions!&amp;nbsp; But yes we danced in the gazebo.&amp;nbsp; we had 50 guests and most people were dancing.&amp;nbsp; It doesn&#039;t look super huge in the pictures but once you get a ton of people in there you&#039;ll see that it is plenty big enough! even if you had a 100 guests, not everyone will dance all the time...it&#039;s basically the size of a regular wedding dance floor...I&#039;ll post a pic of us dancing...ok it&#039;s below.... see there are about 20 of us girls dancing to this song and look at how much room there is still! and there is another level a step down&amp;nbsp;(where at the&amp;nbsp;ceremony we had our parents sit) where my BM is in yellow, it is about&amp;nbsp;5-7 ft wide all the way around, so perfect for the non-dancers to hang out.&amp;nbsp;we even brought some chairs up for&amp;nbsp;people to sit and chat on that 2nd level&amp;nbsp;and as well as down where the chairs are at the ceremony lots of people mingled there and that is where the bar was too.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Unfortunately the sand down by the gazebo is very coarse and you wouldn&#039;t want to dance on it...i was excited for dancing barefoot in the sand and was so diappointed when i found out it wouldn&#039;t happen, but the gazebo worked out even BETTER!! and was perfect for the bouquet and garter toss!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; There are lights down there, in the gazebo and down the walk way (see in pic above of walk way a couple light stands, def gives off enough light so you can see where you are walking. lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; StephAli when is your wedding date?!&amp;nbsp; it&#039;s going to be here before we both know it!!&amp;nbsp; I would talk to Beverly about blue flowers, i&#039;m sure she can get them for you! she&#039;ll do whatever you want, seriously!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"McCrady-7770.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/125900\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1257480,"PostDate":1282143378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks guys!!\u00a0 Mekanbar, no dumb questions!\u00a0 But yes we danced in the gazebo.\u00a0 we had 50 guests and most people were dancing.\u00a0 It doesn't look super huge in the pictures but once you get a ton of people in there you'll see that it is plenty big enough! even if you had a 100 guests, not everyone will dance all the time...it's basically the size of a regular wedding dance floor...I'll post a pic of us dancing...ok it's below.... see there are about 20 of us girls dancing to this song and look at how much room there is still! and there is another level a step down\u00a0(where at the\u00a0ceremony we had our parents sit) where my BM is in yellow, it is about\u00a05-7 ft wide all the way around, so perfect for the non-dancers to hang out.\u00a0we even brought some chairs up for\u00a0people to sit and chat on that 2nd level\u00a0and as well as down where the chairs are at the ceremony lots of people mingled there and that is where the bar was too.<\/p> <p> Unfortunately the sand down by the gazebo is very coarse and you wouldn't want to dance on it...i was excited for dancing barefoot in the sand and was so diappointed when i found out it wouldn't happen, but the gazebo worked out even BETTER!! and was perfect for the bouquet and garter toss!<\/p> <p> There are lights down there, in the gazebo and down the walk way (see in pic above of walk way a couple light stands, def gives off enough light so you can see where you are walking. lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> StephAli when is your wedding date?!\u00a0 it's going to be here before we both know it!!\u00a0 I would talk to Beverly about blue flowers, i'm sure she can get them for you! she'll do whatever you want, seriously!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"McCrady-7770.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/125900\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx\">http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/gartrepic.jpg\">http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/a...\/gartrepic.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerrij@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250884128,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220796.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kerrij","Id":220796,"Name":"kerrij","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9a4b04c34c4967a35615be7991a9d96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; kerrij - thanks so much for posting your pics!!!&amp;nbsp; we&#039;re also not planning on taking any decorations (im sort of a lazy bride to be...lol) so its great to hear that everything is beautiful without.&amp;nbsp; and your bouquet was gorgeous!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; StephAli - what day is your wedding??&amp;nbsp; I think we&#039;ll be there at the same time!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258006,"PostDate":1282159904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> kerrij - thanks so much for posting your pics!!!\u00a0 we're also not planning on taking any decorations (im sort of a lazy bride to be...lol) so its great to hear that everything is beautiful without.\u00a0 and your bouquet was gorgeous!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> StephAli - what day is your wedding??\u00a0 I think we'll be there at the same time!!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daphnetorgal@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275444609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daphne","Id":228753,"Name":"daphne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"196c7d4b214a67e0619cea119615276b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Okay weirdest thing just happened.&amp;nbsp; I was looking on Expedia yesterday to see package prices to see if we really are getting a group rate (from the looks of it, we&#039;re not even though out TA keeps insisting we ARE, depiste me being able to buy it online cheaper)&amp;nbsp; anyways....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; expedia last night showed the hotel as 3 1\/2 stars and the prices were about $50 cheaper then we paid.&amp;nbsp; Now today its $200 MORE and they raised the star level&amp;nbsp;to 5 stars now.&amp;nbsp; I feel like I am going crazy!&amp;nbsp; Stupid expedia.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258173,"PostDate":1282163929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Okay weirdest thing just happened.\u00a0 I was looking on Expedia yesterday to see package prices to see if we really are getting a group rate (from the looks of it, we're not even though out TA keeps insisting we ARE, depiste me being able to buy it online cheaper)\u00a0 anyways....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> expedia last night showed the hotel as 3 1\/2 stars and the prices were about $50 cheaper then we paid.\u00a0 Now today its $200 MORE and they raised the star level\u00a0to 5 stars now.\u00a0 I feel like I am going crazy!\u00a0 Stupid expedia.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3b401ff9ec801297f2757ec7c0f19a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are getting married November 24th! We will be there the 20-27! I can&#039;t wait!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I will send Beverly yet another email :D to ask her about the flowers!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Did you fax your forms\/information package in or were you able to email them??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258254,"PostDate":1282167292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are getting married November 24th! We will be there the 20-27! I can't wait!\u00a0<\/p> <p> I will send Beverly yet another email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> to ask her about the flowers!<\/p> <p> Did you fax your forms\/information package in or were you able to email them??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebd35e0a255ee4918861f3f75d7e9167","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That is really mental!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ps. I had the same issue with our pricing. It is currently listed at exactly what my group is paying....were is the discount?? annoying!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258262,"PostDate":1282167494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That is really mental!!<\/p> <p> Ps. I had the same issue with our pricing. It is currently listed at exactly what my group is paying....were is the discount?? annoying!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d398030d5a58f2b699e74d93c777f78","RawContent":"I never faxed anything in...am I supposed to? My TA made all of the arrangements for us as she is a destination wedding specialist, hmm maybe I should ask her about this form - what is on it?\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]StephAli[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are getting married November 24th! We will be there the 20-27! I can&#039;t wait!  \n I will send Beverly yet another email :D to ask her about the flowers! \n Did you fax your forms\/information package in or were you able to email them??[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1258337,"PostDate":1282170933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I never faxed anything in...am I supposed to? My TA made all of the arrangements for us as she is a destination wedding specialist, hmm maybe I should ask her about this form - what is on it?<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>StephAli<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are getting married November 24th! We will be there the 20-27! I can't wait!\u00a0<\/p> <p> I will send Beverly yet another email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> to ask her about the flowers!<\/p> <p> Did you fax your forms\/information package in or were you able to email them??<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11589c5fd35eaf065546522592d57508","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I didn&#039;t fax it in, I scanned it and emailed it to her!&amp;nbsp; she says that she doesn&#039;t charge you until your room is 100% paid for.&amp;nbsp; other then that the only thing she needs is a long form birth certificate 30 days before the wedding and you&#039;re DONE!!  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; its so frustrating beacuse Ih ave to ask her for things like 3 times before she gets it.&amp;nbsp; I still ahven&#039;t seen the flower samples she was supposed to send, it took 2 months to get the photographer packages etc.&amp;nbsp; So I guess I&#039;ll just pick when I get there, who cares is the best way to go into this, hahaha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; StephAli - That makes me feel so much better!&amp;nbsp; I ahven&#039;t seen this supposed group discount, and every time I ask her what it is, she won&#039;t give me an answer, she ignores the question or says she&#039;ll get back to me, so I\"m thinking there isn&#039;t a group discount!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258395,"PostDate":1282173105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I didn't fax it in, I scanned it and emailed it to her!\u00a0 she says that she doesn't charge you until your room is 100% paid for.\u00a0 other then that the only thing she needs is a long form birth certificate 30 days before the wedding and you're DONE!!\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> its so frustrating beacuse Ih ave to ask her for things like 3 times before she gets it.\u00a0 I still ahven't seen the flower samples she was supposed to send, it took 2 months to get the photographer packages etc.\u00a0 So I guess I'll just pick when I get there, who cares is the best way to go into this, hahaha.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> StephAli - That makes me feel so much better!\u00a0 I ahven't seen this supposed group discount, and every time I ask her what it is, she won't give me an answer, she ignores the question or says she'll get back to me, so I\"m thinking there isn't a group discount!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e80db81818d24b89d7a88fde88ec871","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]katelynn[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I never faxed anything in...am I supposed to? My TA made all of the arrangements for us as she is a destination wedding specialist, hmm maybe I should ask her about this form - what is on it?\n \n   \n  [\/quote] \n Beverly sent me an email with all the wedding packages and then info forms. ie. names, parents names, date, what music you want played (walking down, first dance, etc.), a bunch of other details things....","Attachments":[],"Id":1258581,"PostDate":1282187938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>katelynn<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I never faxed anything in...am I supposed to? My TA made all of the arrangements for us as she is a destination wedding specialist, hmm maybe I should ask her about this form - what is on it?<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <p> Beverly sent me an email with all the wedding packages and then info forms. ie. names, parents names, date, what music you want played (walking down, first dance, etc.), a bunch of other details things....<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75bfb112014da0958536cfde66bc64bb","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]akua420[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I didn&#039;t fax it in, I scanned it and emailed it to her!  she says that she doesn&#039;t charge you until your room is 100% paid for.  other then that the only thing she needs is a long form birth certificate 30 days before the wedding and you&#039;re DONE!!   \n its so frustrating beacuse Ih ave to ask her for things like 3 times before she gets it.  I still ahven&#039;t seen the flower samples she was supposed to send, it took 2 months to get the photographer packages etc.  So I guess I&#039;ll just pick when I get there, who cares is the best way to go into this, hahaha.  \n   \n StephAli - That makes me feel so much better!  I ahven&#039;t seen this supposed group discount, and every time I ask her what it is, she won&#039;t give me an answer, she ignores the question or says she&#039;ll get back to me, so I\"m thinking there isn&#039;t a group discount!!![\/quote] \n \n mmmmm.....what is a long form birth certificate?!? oh no! I was just gonna scan my birth certificate!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1258585,"PostDate":1282188041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>akua420<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I didn't fax it in, I scanned it and emailed it to her!\u00a0 she says that she doesn't charge you until your room is 100% paid for.\u00a0 other then that the only thing she needs is a long form birth certificate 30 days before the wedding and you're DONE!!\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> its so frustrating beacuse Ih ave to ask her for things like 3 times before she gets it.\u00a0 I still ahven't seen the flower samples she was supposed to send, it took 2 months to get the photographer packages etc.\u00a0 So I guess I'll just pick when I get there, who cares is the best way to go into this, hahaha.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> StephAli - That makes me feel so much better!\u00a0 I ahven't seen this supposed group discount, and every time I ask her what it is, she won't give me an answer, she ignores the question or says she'll get back to me, so I\"m thinking there isn't a group discount!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> mmmmm.....what is a long form birth certificate?!? oh no! I was just gonna scan my birth certificate!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26083724dc462aa5b2ac74a54c99c9ed","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]StephAli[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n \n mmmmm.....what is a long form birth certificate?!? oh no! I was just gonna scan my birth certificate!!![\/quote] \n I had to order one.  Its a birth certificate with both your father and mothers name on it, they normally only give the short form with just the birth information.  And even on the form you need a valid reason to request it or they won&#039;t give it to you, well on the Sk and Ab forms you have to put down a reason.    It takes about a month to get it (well in Ab, Sk), and Bev needs a copy 30 days before the wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1258589,"PostDate":1282188296,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>StephAli<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> mmmmm.....what is a long form birth certificate?!? oh no! I was just gonna scan my birth certificate!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I had to order one.\u00a0 Its a birth certificate with both your father and mothers name on it, they normally only give the short form with just the birth information.\u00a0 And even on the form you need a valid reason to request it or they won't give it to you, well on the Sk and Ab forms you have to put down a reason. \u00a0\u00a0 It takes about a month to get it (well in Ab, Sk), and Bev needs a copy 30 days before the wedding.\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":290,"NextPage":300,"PreviousPage":280,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
