{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76978b388e3c2a25f93c52d261bd33a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; oh dear! ok!! looks like I have some work to do!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258927,"PostDate":1282231162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> oh dear! ok!! looks like I have some work to do!!<\/p> <p> Thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f3ce30a2810c806372d55635729bb43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; No problem!&amp;nbsp; I had to order my Fi&#039;s for him he&#039;s so bad at that kind of stuff.&amp;nbsp; If it wasn&#039;t for me we probably wouldn&#039;t be getting married!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258974,"PostDate":1282232931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> No problem!\u00a0 I had to order my Fi's for him he's so bad at that kind of stuff.\u00a0 If it wasn't for me we probably wouldn't be getting married!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"287a7667f28b635168393d6096c64238","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kerrij[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks guys!!  Mekanbar, no dumb questions!  But yes we danced in the gazebo.  we had 50 guests and most people were dancing.  It doesn&#039;t look super huge in the pictures but once you get a ton of people in there you&#039;ll see that it is plenty big enough! even if you had a 100 guests, not everyone will dance all the time...it&#039;s basically the size of a regular wedding dance floor...I&#039;ll post a pic of us dancing...ok it&#039;s below.... see there are about 20 of us girls dancing to this song and look at how much room there is still! and there is another level a step down (where at the ceremony we had our parents sit) where my BM is in yellow, it is about 5-7 ft wide all the way around, so perfect for the non-dancers to hang out. we even brought some chairs up for people to sit and chat on that 2nd level and as well as down where the chairs are at the ceremony lots of people mingled there and that is where the bar was too. \n Unfortunately the sand down by the gazebo is very coarse and you wouldn&#039;t want to dance on it...i was excited for dancing barefoot in the sand and was so diappointed when i found out it wouldn&#039;t happen, but the gazebo worked out even BETTER!! and was perfect for the bouquet and garter toss! \n   \n   \n  [\/quote] \n \n \n Who plays the music during the bouquet\/garter toss?  Another bride also mentioned that they had the first dances right after the wedding ceremony...who runs the music then too?!  Did you bring your own music along??","Attachments":[],"Id":1259033,"PostDate":1282234739,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kerrij<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks guys!!\u00a0 Mekanbar, no dumb questions!\u00a0 But yes we danced in the gazebo.\u00a0 we had 50 guests and most people were dancing.\u00a0 It doesn't look super huge in the pictures but once you get a ton of people in there you'll see that it is plenty big enough! even if you had a 100 guests, not everyone will dance all the time...it's basically the size of a regular wedding dance floor...I'll post a pic of us dancing...ok it's below.... see there are about 20 of us girls dancing to this song and look at how much room there is still! and there is another level a step down\u00a0(where at the\u00a0ceremony we had our parents sit) where my BM is in yellow, it is about\u00a05-7 ft wide all the way around, so perfect for the non-dancers to hang out.\u00a0we even brought some chairs up for\u00a0people to sit and chat on that 2nd level\u00a0and as well as down where the chairs are at the ceremony lots of people mingled there and that is where the bar was too.<\/p> <p> Unfortunately the sand down by the gazebo is very coarse and you wouldn't want to dance on it...i was excited for dancing barefoot in the sand and was so diappointed when i found out it wouldn't happen, but the gazebo worked out even BETTER!! and was perfect for the bouquet and garter toss!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Who plays the music during the bouquet\/garter toss?\u00a0 Another bride also mentioned that they had the first dances right after the wedding ceremony...who runs the music then too?!\u00a0 Did you bring your own music along??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c72e627b09420ac1b40c522eeef9646e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Iam getting married Jan 28 2011 at GBP....I am so glad I have found this forum.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1259061,"PostDate":1282235458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Iam getting married Jan 28 2011 at GBP....I am so glad I have found this forum.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deegraham@sympatico.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282235235,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231521.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DeannaB2B","Id":231521,"Name":"DeannaB2B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0fc449a28f8fcd2409815af0c05ac8b4","RawContent":"Yay! Another gbp bride :) welcome! You&#039;ll love it here!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1259533,"PostDate":1282250887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay! Another gbp bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> welcome! You'll love it here!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6371cab55db5aae8f16c49861fbb7fd0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; The more the merrier!&amp;nbsp; I think this hotel is getting a lot more popular, even the ratings on trip advisor seem to go up.&amp;nbsp; And the week I&#039;m going is already sold out out of Edmonton, so I&#039;m glad I booked it in April or I&#039;d be having to change my wedding day!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1259602,"PostDate":1282253236,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The more the merrier!\u00a0 I think this hotel is getting a lot more popular, even the ratings on trip advisor seem to go up.\u00a0 And the week I'm going is already sold out out of Edmonton, so I'm glad I booked it in April or I'd be having to change my wedding day!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca35edfe538c9cefa23a55f1fb873833","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; welcome to the forum!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1260033,"PostDate":1282275943,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> welcome to the forum!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6113fe6ac099773296397d47fd95712","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Welcome!&amp;nbsp; Glad you could join us!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1260415,"PostDate":1282319883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Welcome!\u00a0 Glad you could join us!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99004bfc25303d51067e1fc7ca303dff","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]StephAli[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I will send Beverly yet another email :D to ask her about the flowers! \n Did you fax your forms\/information package in or were you able to email them??[\/quote] \n \n I did both...faxed and emailed.\n \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]akua420[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n expedia last night showed the hotel as 3 1\/2 stars and the prices were about $50 cheaper then we paid.  Now today its $200 MORE and they raised the star level to 5 stars now.  I feel like I am going crazy!  Stupid expedia.[\/quote] \n \n It WILL drive you crazy!! Once you book stop looking at prices!  it made me mental too...but i did end up lucking out and (I got our group rates in Aug for our March wedding) the end of Nov i found that Nolitours (we booked sunquest or something) had the rates  for about 1500 when our group rate was 1700 and online prices were about 2000....i was PO&#039;d. i told my TA to get Nolitours group rate which was about 200 less!...we probably had 40 people booked at this point so i told my TA to tell sunquest that our group would leave (and loose our 200 deposit) and go to Nolitours (which would still have saved our peeps 200 even though they would loose 200) if they didn&#039;t do something about our price....so they gave everyone an extra 200 off to stay with them.  so we stayed!  so if you find a wicked saves like that...do what i did!\n \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]missy&amp;amp;eric2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Who plays the music during the bouquet\/garter toss?  Another bride also mentioned that they had the first dances right after the wedding ceremony...who runs the music then too?!  Did you bring your own music along??[\/quote] \n \n we did ours during our dance and we chose our own music...but Beverly can set up a sound system (we didn&#039;t have one set up cause we had the steel drums) for the ceremony and she&#039;ll play your dance\/garter\/etc songs there.\n   \n For your Birth Cert you need your original one...like the one that&#039;s about the size of a full size paper, not the wallet size one.  if you don&#039;t have it you can order it from the provincial govt. DHs took about 2-3 weeks to get in and maybe $60. (For a BC one anyway).  Beverly didn&#039;t seem to care about when we got the birth certs to her...i had to just send it cause i knew it was 30 days....a week before the wedding i asked her if she got our certificates and she said, she hasn&#039;t looked yet....so if you don&#039;t get it to her by the 30 days it&#039;s no biggie...just as long as you bring it to the resort. \n   \n Welcome Deanna!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1260437,"PostDate":1282320565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>StephAli<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I will send Beverly yet another email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> to ask her about the flowers!<\/p> <p> Did you fax your forms\/information package in or were you able to email them??<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> I did both...faxed and emailed.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>akua420<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> expedia last night showed the hotel as 3 1\/2 stars and the prices were about $50 cheaper then we paid.\u00a0 Now today its $200 MORE and they raised the star level\u00a0to 5 stars now.\u00a0 I feel like I am going crazy!\u00a0 Stupid expedia.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> It WILL drive you crazy!! Once you book stop looking at prices!\u00a0\u00a0it made me mental too...but i did end up lucking out and (I got our group rates in Aug for our March wedding) the end of Nov i found that Nolitours (we booked sunquest or something) had the rates\u00a0 for about 1500 when our group rate was 1700 and online prices were about 2000....i was PO'd. i told my TA to get Nolitours group rate which was about 200 less!...we probably had 40 people booked at this point so i told my TA to tell sunquest that our group would leave (and loose our 200 deposit) and go to Nolitours (which would still have saved our peeps 200 even though they would loose 200) if they didn't do something about our price....so they gave everyone an extra 200 off to stay with them.\u00a0 so we stayed!\u00a0 so if you find a wicked saves like that...do what i did!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Who plays the music during the bouquet\/garter toss?\u00a0 Another bride also mentioned that they had the first dances right after the wedding ceremony...who runs the music then too?!\u00a0 Did you bring your own music along??<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> we did ours during our dance and we chose our own music...but Beverly can set up a sound system (we didn't have one set up cause we had the steel drums) for the ceremony and she'll play your dance\/garter\/etc songs there.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For your Birth Cert you need your original one...like the one that's about the size of a full size paper, not the wallet size one.\u00a0 if you don't have it you can order it from the provincial govt. DHs took about 2-3 weeks to get in and maybe $60. (For a BC one anyway).\u00a0 Beverly didn't seem to care about when we got the birth certs to her...i had to just send it cause i knew it was 30 days....a week before the wedding i asked her if she got our certificates and she said, she hasn't looked yet....so if you don't get it to her by the 30 days it's no biggie...just as long as you bring it to the resort.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Welcome Deanna!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx\">http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/gartrepic.jpg\">http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/a...\/gartrepic.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerrij@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250884128,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220796.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kerrij","Id":220796,"Name":"kerrij","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb4bdbcd78d71496f874d9c7d9698477","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I mentioned this Long Form BC to our TA and she had no idea what i was talking about...I don&#039;t mean for it to sound like it will...but is this just a Canada thing?&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1260587,"PostDate":1282324294,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I mentioned this Long Form BC to our TA and she had no idea what i was talking about...I don't mean for it to sound like it will...but is this just a Canada thing?\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":300,"NextPage":310,"PreviousPage":290,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
