> User bellabride2018 (287346)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed229ec4ae6df5c36201185d73c1adc0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi everyone, I am getting married at the GBP on October 1st.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I so wish i had found this forum sooner, it would have saved me so much worry and stress. I have been emailing Beverly to ask questions and she never really gives much away, so frustrating when you know you cant do anything until you get there.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have just read each and every post on here, and i have now gone cross eyed....however i do feel much more relaxed about the whole thing. Better get posting so i can actually look at downloads.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Kerri your pictures are lovely, i have friend requested you on facebook so i can see more.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Chat to you all soon, better walk the dog cos she keeps looking at me like &#039;Mum are you still on there!!!!&#039; lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1260618,"PostDate":1282325119,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi everyone, I am getting married at the GBP on October 1st.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I so wish i had found this forum sooner, it would have saved me so much worry and stress. I have been emailing Beverly to ask questions and she never really gives much away, so frustrating when you know you cant do anything until you get there.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have just read each and every post on here, and i have now gone cross eyed....however i do feel much more relaxed about the whole thing. Better get posting so i can actually look at downloads.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kerri your pictures are lovely, i have friend requested you on facebook so i can see more.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Chat to you all soon, better walk the dog cos she keeps looking at me like 'Mum are you still on there!!!!' lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susan.haddy@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282259517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231537.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Notlongnow","Id":231537,"Name":"Notlongnow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8edb48f2b4eaf00971ce80edbb964edc","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]missy&amp;amp;eric2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I mentioned this Long Form BC to our TA and she had no idea what i was talking about...I don&#039;t mean for it to sound like it will...but is this just a Canada thing?  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif[\/img][\/quote] \n \n \n Well I know the different provinces in Canada all call it something different.  Just say a birth certificate with your mother and fathers name on it, cuz thats all &#039;long-form&#039; really means.  \n   \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.visitjamaica.com\/articles\/getting-married-in-jamaica.aspx\"]http:\/\/www.visitjamaica.com\/articles\/getting-married-in-jamaica.aspx[\/url] \n   \n It shows what you need, and it says birth certificate that includes fathers name. \n   \n I don&#039;t know if maybe the US Birth cert&#039;s maybe already have both, and it might just be Canada that doesn&#039;t put the parents name on our wallet-size birth certificates.   Just look at what you have, and if it doesn&#039;t have your dads name then call vital statistics and they will be able to answer your questions, thats what I did.","Attachments":[],"Id":1260726,"PostDate":1282329171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I mentioned this Long Form BC to our TA and she had no idea what i was talking about...I don't mean for it to sound like it will...but is this just a Canada thing?\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Well I know the different provinces in Canada all call it something different.\u00a0 Just say a birth certificate with your mother and fathers name on it, cuz thats all 'long-form' really means.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.visitjamaica.com\/articles\/getting-married-in-jamaica.aspx' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.visitjama...in-jamaica.aspx<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It shows what you need, and it says birth certificate that includes fathers name.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I don't know if maybe the US Birth cert's maybe already have both, and it might just be Canada that doesn't put the parents name on our wallet-size birth certificates.\u00a0\u00a0 Just look at what you have, and if it doesn't have your dads name then call vital statistics and they will be able to answer your questions, thats what I did.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0691214355ad93ec9309df90e914b1fc","RawContent":"REally?!  You get a wallet sized certificate?!  Mine has my footprints on it and it is the size of a normal piece of paper, but thicker!  How bizarre that it would be that different!  Did you need to have the long form one to get your passport??\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]akua420[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n   \n \n \n Well I know the different provinces in Canada all call it something different.  Just say a birth certificate with your mother and fathers name on it, cuz thats all &#039;long-form&#039; really means.  \n   \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.visitjamaica.com\/articles\/getting-married-in-jamaica.aspx\"]http:\/\/www.visitjamaica.com\/articles\/getting-married-in-jamaica.aspx[\/url] \n   \n It shows what you need, and it says birth certificate that includes fathers name. \n   \n I don&#039;t know if maybe the US Birth cert&#039;s maybe already have both, and it might just be Canada that doesn&#039;t put the parents name on our wallet-size birth certificates.   Just look at what you have, and if it doesn&#039;t have your dads name then call vital statistics and they will be able to answer your questions, thats what I did.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1261010,"PostDate":1282336665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> REally?!\u00a0 You get a wallet sized certificate?!\u00a0 Mine has my footprints on it and it is the size of a normal piece of paper, but thicker!\u00a0 How bizarre that it would be that different!\u00a0 Did you need to have the long form one to get your passport??<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>akua420<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Well I know the different provinces in Canada all call it something different.\u00a0 Just say a birth certificate with your mother and fathers name on it, cuz thats all 'long-form' really means.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.visitjamaica.com\/articles\/getting-married-in-jamaica.aspx' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.visitjama...in-jamaica.aspx<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It shows what you need, and it says birth certificate that includes fathers name.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I don't know if maybe the US Birth cert's maybe already have both, and it might just be Canada that doesn't put the parents name on our wallet-size birth certificates.\u00a0\u00a0 Just look at what you have, and if it doesn't have your dads name then call vital statistics and they will be able to answer your questions, thats what I did.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b07f795315f9dbb6f5a28f5afcf0f78","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]missy&amp;amp;eric2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n REally?!  You get a wallet sized certificate?!  Mine has my footprints on it and it is the size of a normal piece of paper, but thicker!  How bizarre that it would be that different!  Did you need to have the long form one to get your passport??\n   \n  [\/quote] \n Nope, you just have to have I think 2 pieces of g&#039;ment issued ID, so I used my dirvers license and my Birth certificate card.  I mean maybe my mom got one and lost it in the last 25 years, but she can only remember the smaller one, and you have to pay to get the big copy with all the additional information.  I&#039;ve only ever seen my card sized one.  It just has the number, your name, your birthday and where you were born.  I guess Canada is a lot different then America!  But no footprints anywhere to be seen on the birth certificates here!  Weird!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1261186,"PostDate":1282342446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> REally?!\u00a0 You get a wallet sized certificate?!\u00a0 Mine has my footprints on it and it is the size of a normal piece of paper, but thicker!\u00a0 How bizarre that it would be that different!\u00a0 Did you need to have the long form one to get your passport??<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <p> Nope, you just have to have I think 2 pieces of g'ment issued ID, so I used my dirvers license and my Birth certificate card.\u00a0 I mean maybe my mom got one and lost it in the last 25 years, but she can only remember the smaller one, and you have to pay to get the big copy with all the additional information.\u00a0 I've only ever seen my card sized one.\u00a0\u00a0It just has the number, your name, your birthday and where you were born.\u00a0 I guess Canada is a lot different then America!\u00a0 But no footprints anywhere to be seen on the birth certificates here!\u00a0 Weird!!!\u00a0<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8a2bb6067c5881de5a8a34b700b4948","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; StephAli - im getting married the week before you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1261699,"PostDate":1282420591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> StephAli - im getting married the week before you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daphnetorgal@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275444609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daphne","Id":228753,"Name":"daphne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ded71cebe3e6e8f43af3c7efb04577d","RawContent":"That is really bizarre...never would have thought that...perhaps I should get to looking into it, but as I said, when I mentioned it to our TA...she looked at me really weird!  lol!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]akua420[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n Nope, you just have to have I think 2 pieces of g&#039;ment issued ID, so I used my dirvers license and my Birth certificate card.  I mean maybe my mom got one and lost it in the last 25 years, but she can only remember the smaller one, and you have to pay to get the big copy with all the additional information.  I&#039;ve only ever seen my card sized one.  It just has the number, your name, your birthday and where you were born.  I guess Canada is a lot different then America!  But no footprints anywhere to be seen on the birth certificates here!  Weird!!! \n \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1264287,"PostDate":1282670424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> That is really bizarre...never would have thought that...perhaps I should get to looking into it, but as I said, when I mentioned it to our TA...she looked at me really weird!\u00a0 lol!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>akua420<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <p> Nope, you just have to have I think 2 pieces of g'ment issued ID, so I used my dirvers license and my Birth certificate card.\u00a0 I mean maybe my mom got one and lost it in the last 25 years, but she can only remember the smaller one, and you have to pay to get the big copy with all the additional information.\u00a0 I've only ever seen my card sized one.\u00a0\u00a0It just has the number, your name, your birthday and where you were born.\u00a0 I guess Canada is a lot different then America!\u00a0 But no footprints anywhere to be seen on the birth certificates here!\u00a0 Weird!!!\u00a0<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff0a8cc7f1cb95afcecc8919fc9c78a5","RawContent":"Yay!  Finally got to see your pics!  Very beautiful!  It is sooo exciting seeing these!  Not to mention a huge relief to see really how gorgeous the place is!!! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JMarie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Here are some pics Ladies! I don&#039;t have access to see if they downloaded or not! I only have 15 posts and I think you need 150 but let me know if you guys can see them! \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n   \n     \n   \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[{"Id":20382,"Name":"wedding 050.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-13862210938.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-13862210938_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20383,"Name":"wedding 053.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109384.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109384_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20384,"Name":"wedding 058.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109386.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109386_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20385,"Name":"wedding 059.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109388.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109388_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20386,"Name":"wedding 065.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109391.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109391_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20387,"Name":"wedding 067.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109393.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109393_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20388,"Name":"wedding 072.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109395.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109395_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20389,"Name":"wedding 084.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109398.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-138622109398_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480},{"Id":20390,"Name":"wedding 086.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-1386221094.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-28788-1386221094_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480}],"Id":1264822,"PostDate":1282684229,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Yay!\u00a0 Finally got to see your pics!\u00a0 Very beautiful!\u00a0 It is sooo exciting seeing these!\u00a0 Not to mention a huge relief to see really how gorgeous the place is!!!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JMarie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Here are some pics Ladies! I don't have access to see if they downloaded or not! I only have 15 posts and I think you need 150 but let me know if you guys can see them!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7516\",\"name\":\"wedding 050.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"131\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7517\",\"name\":\"wedding 053.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"114\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7518\",\"name\":\"wedding 058.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"137\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7519\",\"name\":\"wedding 059.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"127\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7520\",\"name\":\"wedding 065.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"135\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7521\",\"name\":\"wedding 067.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"125\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7522\",\"name\":\"wedding 072.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"126\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7523\",\"name\":\"wedding 084.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"99\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7524\",\"name\":\"wedding 086.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"83\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e32516dbc9916e82c5dccce1d6e3a3d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies! Now that I figured out how to upload photos I thought I would share these. My Aunt &amp;amp; Uncle stayed at this resort in 2006 and these are some of their vacation photos. At the time a lot of the resort was still under construction and I believe that there was only one ala carte open (so no pics of the restaurants, sorry), but the had a fab time and have wanted to go back ever since.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Jamaica 084.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132066\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Jamaica 085.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132064\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Jamaica 031.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132061\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Jamaica 136.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132059\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1265978,"PostDate":1282756910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies! Now that I figured out how to upload photos I thought I would share these. My Aunt & Uncle stayed at this resort in 2006 and these are some of their vacation photos. At the time a lot of the resort was still under construction and I believe that there was only one ala carte open (so no pics of the restaurants, sorry), but the had a fab time and have wanted to go back ever since.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Jamaica 084.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132066\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Jamaica 085.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132064\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Jamaica 031.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132061\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Jamaica 136.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/132059\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member"