ments":[],"Id":1269025,"PostDate":1282924474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just noticed the dates on the photos, and they were there on our wedding day in 2006. We are getting married February 7th 2011! That's kinda cool and they said the weather was great except for one cloudy day.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a26701e656dfff3a9aec2314da03a05","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Quick question for those brides who have already gotten married...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; When you had your dinner were the tables rectangle and how many guests sat at each? I am trying to fiddle with centrepieces and seating charts and thought it would be helpful to know..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1270498,"PostDate":1283040397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Quick question for those brides who have already gotten married...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> When you had your dinner were the tables rectangle and how many guests sat at each? I am trying to fiddle with centrepieces and seating charts and thought it would be helpful to know..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a7826dfcfac8d9c53e37a7ab4683632","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Don&#039;t know if you ladies or any of your FI&#039;s or people in your wedding party like to golf; but currently on the GBPJ page on Facebook, they are advertising to ask about their unlimited golfing package...I have our TA trying to get in touch with Beverly about it (she seems to be MIA again)&amp;nbsp;to see if it will still apply next year when many of us will be down there...I will share the updates when I receive them!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1275211,"PostDate":1283370458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Don't know if you ladies or any of your FI's or people in your wedding party like to golf; but currently on the GBPJ page on Facebook, they are advertising to ask about their unlimited golfing package...I have our TA trying to get in touch with Beverly about it (she seems to be MIA again)\u00a0to see if it will still apply next year when many of us will be down there...I will share the updates when I receive them!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"393793098708cb0b76b13b08a5a0a8b1","RawContent":"\n\n&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;missy&amp;eric2011&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img style=\"border: 0px solid;\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;\n Don&#039;t know if you ladies or any of your FI&#039;s or people in your wedding party like to golf; but currently on the GBPJ page on Facebook, they are advertising to ask about their unlimited golfing package...I have our TA trying to get in touch with Beverly about it (she seems to be MIA again)&amp;nbsp;to see if it will still apply next year when many of us will be down there...I will share the updates when I receive them!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\n\n \n Good to know! Thanks for the info!","Attachments":[],"Id":1275720,"PostDate":1283393428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br><br><div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' style=\"border: 0px solid;\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br><br><p><br> Don't know if you ladies or any of your FI's or people in your wedding party like to golf; but currently on the GBPJ page on Facebook, they are advertising to ask about their unlimited golfing package...I have our TA trying to get in touch with Beverly about it (she seems to be MIA again)\u00a0to see if it will still apply next year when many of us will be down there...I will share the updates when I receive them!\u00a0<\/p><\/div><\/div><br><br><br> <br> Good to know! Thanks for the info!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44185c0fcf23e29f2bcbb5e6e8c5e4df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am NOT going to be showing that to anybody, I am not planning on golfing, hahaha, and my F-in-Law is a HUGE golfer so if he knew he&#039;d be golfing the entire time, so nope, not goign tomention UNLIMITED golfing, hahahha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1277655,"PostDate":1283536679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am NOT going to be showing that to anybody, I am not planning on golfing, hahaha, and my F-in-Law is a HUGE golfer so if he knew he'd be golfing the entire time, so nope, not goign tomention UNLIMITED golfing, hahahha<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ad0a9cd955f35301a87c31edd755eef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; ditto!&amp;nbsp; what they dont know wont hurt them right?? lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1277841,"PostDate":1283541286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> ditto!\u00a0 what they dont know wont hurt them right?? lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daphnetorgal@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275444609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daphne","Id":228753,"Name":"daphne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6acad0a34400983b596958a530f9340e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!!! I&#039;m back!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve spent the past few hours catching up on all the comments, wow, you&#039;ve been busy!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It&#039;s been a really hectic month with job changes, the death of a friend, and struggling with an awful travel agent (who we&#039;ve since stopped dealing with thank goodness). We also have our wedding social (Manitoba tradition) coming up this weekend so we&#039;ve been doing a lot of work planning that as well.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re finally booked! 20 people including us. YAY!!!! We had to change our wedding date from May.2nd\/2011 to April.28\/2011 because of flights, which was a pain in itself, but it&#039;s DONE!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n Dress is bought, Bridesmaids dresses are bought (with one extra because my one BM has pretty much backed out... ugh), FI&#039;s suit is bought, Save the Dates are sent out, and photographer has been booked. I&#039;m hoping we&#039;re somewhere on track.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We were originally going to book the private room for our reception but are reconsidering. The 2500 is a lot of money...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyways, that&#039;s my little update.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;lt;3 Tris&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1279109,"PostDate":1283729777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!!! I'm back!<\/p> <p> I've spent the past few hours catching up on all the comments, wow, you've been busy!<\/p> <p> It's been a really hectic month with job changes, the death of a friend, and struggling with an awful travel agent (who we've since stopped dealing with thank goodness). We also have our wedding social (Manitoba tradition) coming up this weekend so we've been doing a lot of work planning that as well.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're finally booked! 20 people including us. YAY!!!! We had to change our wedding date from May.2nd\/2011 to April.28\/2011 because of flights, which was a pain in itself, but it's DONE!<\/p> <p> <br \/> Dress is bought, Bridesmaids dresses are bought (with one extra because my one BM has pretty much backed out... ugh), FI's suit is bought, Save the Dates are sent out, and photographer has been booked. I'm hoping we're somewhere on track.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We were originally going to book the private room for our reception but are reconsidering. The 2500 is a lot of money...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyways, that's my little update.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <3 Tris<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married my best friend 04\/28\/11 at the Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trista.lundquist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1273793347,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228171.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tris","Id":228171,"Name":"tris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c419c7a2a042988b054d7946d233194a","RawContent":"I hear ya how life can get in the way! I was actually wondering where you had been, lol. \n   \n Thats shitty about the travel agent etc but everything will work out in the end...I have had to tell myself that many times already during this planning process! :) \n   \n Have fun at your social!\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]tris[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi ladies!!! I&#039;m back! \n I&#039;ve spent the past few hours catching up on all the comments, wow, you&#039;ve been busy! \n It&#039;s been a really hectic month with job changes, the death of a friend, and struggling with an awful travel agent (who we&#039;ve since stopped dealing with thank goodness). We also have our wedding social (Manitoba tradition) coming up this weekend so we&#039;ve been doing a lot of work planning that as well. \n   \n We&#039;re finally booked! 20 people including us. YAY!!!! We had to change our wedding date from May.2nd\/2011 to April.28\/2011 because of flights, which was a pain in itself, but it&#039;s DONE! \n \n Dress is bought, Bridesmaids dresses are bought (with one extra because my one BM has pretty much backed out... ugh), FI&#039;s suit is bought, Save the Dates are sent out, and photographer has been booked. I&#039;m hoping we&#039;re somewhere on track. \n   \n We were originally going to book the private room for our reception but are reconsidering. The 2500 is a lot of money... \n   \n Anyways, that&#039;s my little update. \n   \n &amp;lt;3 Tris[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1279561,"PostDate":1283809810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I hear ya how life can get in the way! I was actually wondering where you had been, lol.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thats shitty about the travel agent etc but everything will work out in the end...I have had to tell myself that many times already during this planning process! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Have fun at your social!<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>tris<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi ladies!!! I'm back!<\/p> <p> I've spent the past few hours catching up on all the comments, wow, you've been busy!<\/p> <p> It's been a really hectic month with job changes, the death of a friend, and struggling with an awful travel agent (who we've since stopped dealing with thank goodness). We also have our wedding social (Manitoba tradition) coming up this weekend so we've been doing a lot of work planning that as well.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're finally booked! 20 people including us. YAY!!!! We had to change our wedding date from May.2nd\/2011 to April.28\/2011 because of flights, which was a pain in itself, but it's DONE!<\/p> <p> <br \/> Dress is bought, Bridesmaids dresses are bought (with one extra because my one BM has pretty much backed out... ugh), FI's suit is bought, Save the Dates are sent out, and photographer has been booked. I'm hoping we're somewhere on track.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We were originally going to book the private room for our reception but are reconsidering. The 2500 is a lot of money...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyways, that's my little update.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <3 Tris<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3278dfdc26db41dfe2ea36a70640329","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Im all booked !! Jamaica here we come ! wedding date is Oct 18, 2011 :) I hope time will just fly by !&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1281857,"PostDate":1284001339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Im all booked !! Jamaica here we come ! wedding date is Oct 18, 2011 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I hope time will just fly by !<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><em>October 18, 2011 Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay Jamaica<\/em><br><em>I married my bestfriend with 60 of our closest family and friends<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>and I would do it all over again <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"v_makel@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281111200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231088.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"toesinsand30","Id":231088,"Name":"toesinsand30","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":320,"NextPage":330,"PreviousPage":310,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
