> User bellabride2018 (287346)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94591b2e752bd9f7cbfddf7d787e91af","RawContent":"Things have been going well...but it seems like there is still a lot to do for some reason. A couple of weeks ago we sent out our first newsletter after everyone booked to give them more info, and we also got our BM dresses. Also, while I was home my MOH and mom threw a suprise pampered chef shower for me that was a total suprise and amazing! Still waiting on my dress and the favours to come in but thats about it....just seems like little things now. I am currently looking into flowers as everything I have seen all has roses which I dont want, so we will see! I really under estimated how much work it would be to plan a wedding a do schooling and work full time all at once...I keep dreaming of laying on the beach with a cold drink in my hand! lol \n \n We fly in on the 30th so maybe we will see eachother in passing. How are things going with you? \n \n \n \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]tris[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We booked in about 10 months advance and then had to change the date. Ugh... \n \n Katelynn - How&#039;s planning going??? Since I moved to April I haven&#039;t been able to keep up with you as much. I don&#039;t think we&#039;ll end up being at the resort at the same time anymore... We&#039;re leaving April.30th and *hoping* to do a week at Sandles Ochos Rios for our honeymoon right afterwards.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1308068,"PostDate":1286576468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Things have been going well...but it seems like there is still a lot to do for some reason. A couple of weeks ago we sent out our first newsletter after everyone booked to give them more info, and we also got our BM dresses. Also, while I was home my MOH and mom threw a suprise pampered chef shower for me that was a total suprise and amazing! Still waiting on my dress and the favours to come in but thats about it....just seems like little things now. I am currently looking into flowers as everything I have seen all has roses which I dont want, so we will see! I really under estimated how much work it would be to plan a wedding a do schooling and work full time\u00a0all at once...I keep dreaming of laying on the beach with a cold drink in my hand! lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We fly in on the 30th so maybe we will see eachother in passing. How are things going with you?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>tris<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We booked in about 10 months advance and then had to change the date. Ugh...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Katelynn - How's planning going??? Since I moved to April I haven't been able to keep up with you as much. I don't think we'll end up being at the resort at the same time anymore... We're leaving April.30th and *hoping* to do a week at Sandles Ochos Rios for our honeymoon right afterwards.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad0992018a9757d30f517d0d0d7d1c8a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;katelynn&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Things have been going well...but it seems like there is still a lot to do for some reason. A couple of weeks ago we sent out our first newsletter after everyone booked to give them more info, and we also got our BM dresses. Also, while I was home my MOH and mom threw a suprise pampered chef shower for me that was a total suprise and amazing! Still waiting on my dress and the favours to come in but thats about it....just seems like little things now. I am currently looking into flowers as everything I have seen all has roses which I dont want, so we will see! I really under estimated how much work it would be to plan a wedding a do schooling and work full time&amp;nbsp;all at once...I keep dreaming of laying on the beach with a cold drink in my hand! lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We fly in on the 30th so maybe we will see eachother in passing. How are things going with you?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n Things are going pretty good. Dress is bought, bridesmaids dresses are bought, FI&#039;s suit is bought (still need tie &amp;amp; shoes). Trip is booked, us + 17 guests as of right now. We&#039;re having our honeymoon at Sandals Ochos Rios the week after, so we&#039;ll be going straight there from GBP on the 30th. So that will be booked and paid for next week. We&#039;re going to be doing our registry in November. Photographer is booked.&amp;nbsp; Save the dates were sent out middle of August. Our website is up, I need to update it a bit but what can you do, I&#039;m busy! (www.tristaandkai.com)\n ..&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I haven&#039;t started with flowers yet... they&#039;re not a big deal to me (I&#039;m not a big flowers person), but I agree that roses can be kind of cliche. It Beverly would ever get back to me I&#039;d ask her about them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1308584,"PostDate":1286671596,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>katelynn<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Things have been going well...but it seems like there is still a lot to do for some reason. A couple of weeks ago we sent out our first newsletter after everyone booked to give them more info, and we also got our BM dresses. Also, while I was home my MOH and mom threw a suprise pampered chef shower for me that was a total suprise and amazing! Still waiting on my dress and the favours to come in but thats about it....just seems like little things now. I am currently looking into flowers as everything I have seen all has roses which I dont want, so we will see! I really under estimated how much work it would be to plan a wedding a do schooling and work full time\u00a0all at once...I keep dreaming of laying on the beach with a cold drink in my hand! lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We fly in on the 30th so maybe we will see eachother in passing. How are things going with you?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/div> <\/div> <p> <br \/> Things are going pretty good. Dress is bought, bridesmaids dresses are bought, FI's suit is bought (still need tie & shoes). Trip is booked, us + 17 guests as of right now. We're having our honeymoon at Sandals Ochos Rios the week after, so we'll be going straight there from GBP on the 30th. So that will be booked and paid for next week. We're going to be doing our registry in November. Photographer is booked.\u00a0 Save the dates were sent out middle of August. Our website is up, I need to update it a bit but what can you do, I'm busy! (www.tristaandkai.com)<br \/> ..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I haven't started with flowers yet... they're not a big deal to me (I'm not a big flowers person), but I agree that roses can be kind of cliche. It Beverly would ever get back to me I'd ask her about them!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married my best friend 04\/28\/11 at the Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trista.lundquist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1273793347,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228171.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tris","Id":228171,"Name":"tris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7505d0ccf857b166a17359f1256e857","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m in the process of booking a August 2011 wedding at the GBP!! I&#039;m so glad I found this forum, there are so many good ideas and great info! I emailed Beverly to try and set a date with her but no response yet, hopefully soon!! &lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1309460,"PostDate":1286819767,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Ladies,<\/p> <p> I'm in the process of booking a August 2011 wedding at the GBP!! I'm so glad I found this forum, there are so many good ideas and great info! I emailed Beverly to try and set a date with her but no response yet, hopefully soon!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahmconnors@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1286688453,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Espejo2be","Id":233060,"Name":"Espejo2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e594218ccc7f6c00655f3460791a80b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting married at the GBP in April 2011, and this thread\/forum has been a lifesaver!&amp;nbsp; Although I feel like a slacker compared to most of you - you&#039;re all shaming me into doing much more than I thought I would for a DW &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;But there are just so many great ideas!!&amp;nbsp; Anyone else going to be there from April 1-8?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1310728,"PostDate":1286925332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm getting married at the GBP in April 2011, and this thread\/forum has been a lifesaver!\u00a0 Although I feel like a slacker compared to most of you - you're all shaming me into doing much more than I thought I would for a DW <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span>\u00a0But there are just so many great ideas!!\u00a0 Anyone else going to be there from April 1-8?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ea3fcd2d9abf7d1cdc54120c0aafa72","RawContent":"Hey paddies, I had noticed some comments on here about Tai Flora (theflower vendor) being kinda pricey. Where were you able to find prices? I didn&#039;t see anything on their website and I emailed them for a quote, but still no reply. \n \n Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1312657,"PostDate":1287091005,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey paddies, I had noticed some comments on here about Tai Flora (theflower vendor) being kinda pricey. Where were you able to find prices? I didn't see anything on their website and I emailed them for a quote, but still no reply. <br> <br> Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14aa854eecfbb4100f182f97d3099274","RawContent":"Oops meant to say ladies not paddies. Gotta love ipads autofill","Attachments":[],"Id":1312659,"PostDate":1287091058,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oops meant to say ladies not paddies. Gotta love ipads autofill\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a0e300462bf63d30bb89297fa5a6f34","RawContent":"Wow...Im surprised that you didn&#039;t get an answer from TiaFloral.  That was where I got my prices from.  My quote was around $3,000 for the flowers!  That was for my bouquet, 5 bm bouquets, 2 junior bm, my FI bout, 5 gm bouts, centerpieces for the tables, tablecloths, blah blah, blah...this was supposed to be easier...I don&#039;t want all this stuff!  So i had them revise the quote and take a bunch of stuff out, but it was still around $1800 and I thought, this is ridiculous...so I have now found some real touch flowers for me and my 5 bm&#039;s, we are going to make everyone elses...I don&#039;t care about tablecloths, some flowers come with our wedding package so that is going to be all we are using.  I refuse to pay that much money for all these flowers when people won&#039;t be able to keep them and enjoy them!\n \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hey paddies, I had noticed some comments on here about Tai Flora (theflower vendor) being kinda pricey. Where were you able to find prices? I didn&#039;t see anything on their website and I emailed them for a quote, but still no reply.\n \n Thanks[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1312752,"PostDate":1287093452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"> Wow...Im surprised that you didn't get an answer from TiaFloral.\u00a0 That was where I got my prices from.\u00a0 My quote was around $3,000 for the flowers!\u00a0 That was for my bouquet, 5 bm bouquets, 2 junior bm, my FI bout, 5 gm bouts, centerpieces for the tables, tablecloths, blah blah, blah...this was supposed to be easier...I don't want all this stuff!\u00a0 So i had them revise the quote and take a bunch of stuff out, but it was still around $1800 and I thought, this is ridiculous...so I have now found some real touch flowers for me and my 5 bm's, we are going to make everyone elses...I don't care about tablecloths, some flowers come with our wedding package so that is going to be all we are using.\u00a0 I refuse to pay that much money for all these flowers when people won't be able to keep them and enjoy them!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/div> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hey paddies, I had noticed some comments on here about Tai Flora (theflower vendor) being kinda pricey. Where were you able to find prices? I didn't see anything on their website and I emailed them for a quote, but still no reply.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"238c40452b657d69c2f60d012d803856","RawContent":"They sent me their package and I have it saved in my email, so if you want it PM me your addy and I&#039;ll send it to you. I felt they were pricey and didnt have what I wanted...they were ALL roses and I am not a rose person, in my email to them I even stated no roses...lol \n \n I am still waiting to hear back from the garden place...but so far to me Jan&#039;s is best!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hey paddies, I had noticed some comments on here about Tai Flora (theflower vendor) being kinda pricey. Where were you able to find prices? I didn&#039;t see anything on their website and I emailed them for a quote, but still no reply.\n \n Thanks[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1312867,"PostDate":1287103547,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> They sent me their package and I have it saved in my email, so if you want it PM me your addy and I'll send it to you. I felt they were pricey and didnt have what I wanted...they were ALL roses and I am not a rose person, in my email to them I even stated no roses...lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am still waiting to hear back from the garden place...but so far to me Jan's is best!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hey paddies, I had noticed some comments on here about Tai Flora (theflower vendor) being kinda pricey. Where were you able to find prices? I didn't see anything on their website and I emailed them for a quote, but still no reply.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e31bc8123479875c524dcd12146d1fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Katelynn,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Would you be able to email me that information? I&#039;ll PM you my email address.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1312912,"PostDate":1287111624,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Katelynn,<\/p> <p> Would you be able to email me that information? I'll PM you my email address.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married my best friend 04\/28\/11 at the Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trista.lundquist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1273793347,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228171.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tris","Id":228171,"Name":"tris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9f6735287a562c148d87f32f1c604aa","RawContent":"Missy - wow that does seem very pricey for flowers. I&#039;m thinking of having my bm&#039;s carry parasols instead of bouquets. I&#039;ve found some really cute photos with the parasols. Thanks for the info!\n \n Katelynn - I pm&#039;d you and thanks again!","Attachments":[],"Id":1313506,"PostDate":1287176123,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Missy - wow that does seem very pricey for flowers. I'm thinking of having my bm's carry parasols instead of bouquets. I've found some really cute photos with the parasols. Thanks for the info!<br> <br> Katelynn - I pm'd you and thanks again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":360,"NextPage":370,"PreviousPage":350,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
